hadiths[338]{hadithnumber,text}:
"5040","Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aagah raho ! jo shakhs shib-hey-Amad wali surat mein ghalati sey maara jaey, maslan : kodey aur dandey waghera sey, uski diyat sau oont hai jin mein sey chaalis oontniyaan hamila hongi."
"5041","Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aagah raho ! jo shakhs shib-hey-Amad wali surat mein ghalati sey maara jaey, maslan : kodey aur dandey waghera sey, uski diyat sau oont hai jin mein sey chaalis oontniyaan hamila hongi."
"5042","Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key eik sahabi sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney fateh Makka key din khutba irshad farmaya. (us mein) aap ney farmaya : aagah raho ! jaan boojh kar kiye gaye shubhey ki surat mein kodey, dandey ya patthar key sath ghalati sey maarey janey waley shakhs ki diyat sau oont hai jin mein sey chaalis saniya (paanch saal ki oontni) sey bazil (aath saal ki oontni) aam tak hon aur un mein sey har eik hamila ho."
"5043","Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key eik sahabi sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney fateh Makka key din khutba irshad farmaya. (us mein) aap ney farmaya : aagah raho ! jaan boojh kar kiye gaye shubhey ki surat mein kodey, dandey ya patthar key sath ghalati sey maarey janey waley shakhs ki diyat sau oont hai jin mein sey chaalis saniya (paanch saal ki oontni) sey bazil (aath saal ki oontni) aam tak hon aur un mein sey har eik hamila ho."
"5044","Hazrat Aqba bin Aus sey manqul hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs kodey ya dandey, sontey key sath ghalati sey maara jaey, uski diyat mughalliza (gandi), yani sakht hogi, sau oont jin mein sey chaalis oontniyaan hamila hon."
"5045","Hazrat Aqba bin Aus sey manqul hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs kodey ya dandey, sontey key sath ghalati sey maara jaey, uski diyat mughalliza (gandi), yani sakht hogi, sau oont jin mein sey chaalis oontniyaan hamila hon."
"5046","Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key eik sahabi sey manqul hai ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) fateh Makka key din Makka Mukarrama mein dakhil huye to aap ney farmaya : aagah raho ! jo shakhs ghalati sey shib-hey-Amad ki surat mein maara jaey kodey aur dandey,sontey key sath to uski diyat key oonton mein chaalis oontniyan aisi hun jinkey pet mein bachchey hon."
"5047","Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key eik sahabi sey manqul hai ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) fateh Makka key din Makka Mukarrama mein dakhil huye to aap ney farmaya : aagah raho ! jo shakhs ghalati sey shib-hey-Amad ki surat mein maara jaey kodey aur dandey,sontey key sath to uski diyat key oonton mein chaalis oontniyan aisi hun jinkey pet mein bachchey hon."
"5048","Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key eik sahabi ney bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) jab fateh Makka key moqe par Makka Mukarrama tashrif laye to aap ney farmaya : aagah raho ! jo maqtool shib-hey-Amad ki surat mein ghalati sey kodey ya dandey, sauntey sey maara jaey, uski diyat key oonton mein sey chaalis oontniyaan aisi hon jinkey pet mein bachchey hon."
"5049","Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key eik sahabi ney bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) jab fateh Makka key moqe par Makka Mukarrama tashrif laye to aap ney farmaya : aagah raho ! jo maqtool shib-hey-Amad ki surat mein ghalati sey kodey ya dandey, sauntey sey maara jaey, uski diyat key oonton mein sey chaalis oontniyaan aisi hon jinkey pet mein bachchey hon."
"5050","Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key eik sahabi sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) fateh Makka key saal Makka Mukarrama mein dakhil huye to farmaya : khabrdar ! jo shakhs shib-hey-Amad ki surat mein kodey ya sauntey key sath ghalati sey qatl ho jaey, uski diyat mein sey chaalis oontniyaan aisi hon jinkey pet mein bachchey hon."
"5051","Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key eik sahabi sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) fateh Makka key saal Makka Mukarrama mein dakhil huye to farmaya : khabrdar ! jo shakhs shib-hey-Amad ki surat mein kodey ya sauntey key sath ghalati sey qatl ho jaey, uski diyat mein sey chaalis oontniyaan aisi hon jinkey pet mein bachchey hon."
"5052","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) fateh Makka key din Kaabey ki seedhi par khadey huye. aap ney Allah Taala ki hamd aur sanaa bayan ki aur farmaya : sab tareef Allah Taala key liye hai jisney apna waada sachcha kar dikhaya aur apney bandey (Hazrat Muhammad Mustafa (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki madad farmaee, isi ke sath us akeley ney kuffar ki tamam jamaaton ko shikast sey dochaar kiya. suno ! jo shakhs shib-hey-Amad ki surat mein kodey ya sauntey key sath ghalti se maara jaey, uski diyat sakht hogi. (yani aisey) sau oont jin mein sey chaalis oontniyaan hamila hongi."
"5053","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) fateh Makka key din Kaabey ki seedhi par khadey huye. aap ney Allah Taala ki hamd aur sanaa bayan ki aur farmaya : sab tareef Allah Taala key liye hai jisney apna waada sachcha kar dikhaya aur apney bandey (Hazrat Muhammad Mustafa (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki madad farmaee, isi ke sath us akeley ney kuffar ki tamam jamaaton ko shikast sey dochaar kiya. suno ! jo shakhs shib-hey-Amad ki surat mein kodey ya sauntey key sath ghalti se maara jaey, uski diyat sakht hogi. (yani aisey) sau oont jin mein sey chaalis oontniyaan hamila hongi."
"5054","Hazrat Qasim bin Rabeea sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : qatle-khata shib-hey-Amad ki surat mein, yani jo kodey ya sauntey key sath ho, is mein diyat sau oont hai jin mein sey chaalis oontniyaan hamila hon."
"5055","Hazrat Qasim bin Rabeea sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : qatle-khata shib-hey-Amad ki surat mein, yani jo kodey ya sauntey key sath ho, is mein diyat sau oont hai jin mein sey chaalis oontniyaan hamila hon."
"5056","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib key pardada (Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu)) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs khata (ghalati sey) maara jaey, uski diyat sau oont hai. tees binte makhaz (eik saala oontni), tees binte labun (do saala oontni), tees hiqqey (teen saala oontni) aur das ibne labun (eik saala muzakkir). unhon ( Abdullah bin Amr) ney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) bastiyon (gaaun) main rehney waley logon par is diyat ki qeemat chaar sau deenar ya uskey barabar chaandi muqarrar farmatey they aur oonton walon par un ki qeemat waqt key lihaz sey aaid farmatey they. jab oont mahnge hotey to qeemat badha detey aur agar sastey ho jatey to qeemat kam lagatey, jo bhi hoti. aap key daure-mubarak mein ye qeemat chaar sau deenar sey aath sau deenar tak rahi ya uskey barabar chaandi thi. unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney ye faisla bhi farmaya ke jo shakhs gaayon sey diyat dena chahey to gaayon walon par diyat do sau gaey hogi aur jo shakhs bakriyon sey dena chahey to diyat do hazar bakri hogi. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney faisla farmaya ke diyat bhi virasat ki tarah maqtool key warison mein taqseem hogi. in ko unkey muqarrara hisson key mutabiq di jaeygi. agar koi maal bach jaey to wo maqtool key usba ko milega. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney faisla farmaya tha ke aurat ki taraf sey diyat to uskey usba bharengey , jo bhi hon lekin wo uski virasat sey kuchh hasil nahin kerengey siwaey iske ke warison ko unkey muqarrara hisson ki adaegi key baad kuchh bach jaey (to wo bator usba in ko milega). aur agar koi aurat qatl kar di jaey to uski diyat warison mein taqseem hogi aur wohi qatil ko qatl kerengey (agar wo maaf na keren)."
"5057","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib key pardada (Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu)) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs khata (ghalati sey) maara jaey, uski diyat sau oont hai. tees binte makhaz (eik saala oontni), tees binte labun (do saala oontni), tees hiqqey (teen saala oontni) aur das ibne labun (eik saala muzakkir). unhon ( Abdullah bin Amr) ney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) bastiyon (gaaun) main rehney waley logon par is diyat ki qeemat chaar sau deenar ya uskey barabar chaandi muqarrar farmatey they aur oonton walon par un ki qeemat waqt key lihaz sey aaid farmatey they. jab oont mahnge hotey to qeemat badha detey aur agar sastey ho jatey to qeemat kam lagatey, jo bhi hoti. aap key daure-mubarak mein ye qeemat chaar sau deenar sey aath sau deenar tak rahi ya uskey barabar chaandi thi. unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney ye faisla bhi farmaya ke jo shakhs gaayon sey diyat dena chahey to gaayon walon par diyat do sau gaey hogi aur jo shakhs bakriyon sey dena chahey to diyat do hazar bakri hogi. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney faisla farmaya ke diyat bhi virasat ki tarah maqtool key warison mein taqseem hogi. in ko unkey muqarrara hisson key mutabiq di jaeygi. agar koi maal bach jaey to wo maqtool key usba ko milega. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney faisla farmaya tha ke aurat ki taraf sey diyat to uskey usba bharengey , jo bhi hon lekin wo uski virasat sey kuchh hasil nahin kerengey siwaey iske ke warison ko unkey muqarrara hisson ki adaegi key baad kuchh bach jaey (to wo bator usba in ko milega). aur agar koi aurat qatl kar di jaey to uski diyat warison mein taqseem hogi aur wohi qatil ko qatl kerengey (agar wo maaf na keren)."
"5058","Hazrat ibne-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney qatle-khata ki diyat key barey mein faisla farmaya ke in mein bees binte-makhas (eik saala oontni) bees ibne makhaz (eik saala muzakkir) bees binte-labun (do saala oontni ) bees juzaa (chaar saala oontni) aur bees hiqqey (tees saala oontni) hongey."
"5059","Hazrat ibne-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney qatle-khata ki diyat key barey mein faisla farmaya ke in mein bees binte-makhas (eik saala oontni) bees ibne makhaz (eik saala muzakkir) bees binte-labun (do saala oontni ) bees juzaa (chaar saala oontni) aur bees hiqqey (tees saala oontni) hongey."
"5060","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key daure-mubarak main eik aadmi ney dusrey aadmi ko qatl kar diya. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney uski diyat baara hazar dirham muqarrar farmaee. Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya ke Allah Taala ka farman : (وَ ما نَقَمُوْٓا اِلَّآ اَنْ اَغْنٰہُمُ Allah ...),''aur nahin intiqam liya unhoney magar is baat ka ke Allah Taala aur uskey Rasool ney in ko apney Fazal sey ghani farmaya.'' diyat leney key barey mein hai. aur (mazkura ) alfaz abu-Daawood Harrani key hain."
"5061","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key daure-mubarak main eik aadmi ney dusrey aadmi ko qatl kar diya. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney uski diyat baara hazar dirham muqarrar farmaee. Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya ke Allah Taala ka farman : (وَ ما نَقَمُوْٓا اِلَّآ اَنْ اَغْنٰہُمُ Allah ...),''aur nahin intiqam liya unhoney magar is baat ka ke Allah Taala aur uskey Rasool ney in ko apney Fazal sey ghani farmaya.'' diyat leney key barey mein hai. aur (mazkura ) alfaz abu-Daawood Harrani key hain."
"5062","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney diyat baara hazar dirham muqarrar farmaee."
"5063","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney diyat baara hazar dirham muqarrar farmaee."
"5064","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib key pardada (Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu)) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aurat ki diyat mard key barabar hai yahan tak ke tihai ko pahunch jaey."
"5065","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib key pardada (Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu)) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aurat ki diyat mard key barabar hai yahan tak ke tihai ko pahunch jaey."
"5066","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib key pardada sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : zimmi ki diyat musalman sey nisf (aadhi) hai. zimmi sey murad Yahud aur nasara hain."
"5067","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib key pardada sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : zimmi ki diyat musalman sey nisf (aadhi) hai. zimmi sey murad Yahud aur nasara hain."
"5068","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kafir ki diyat momin ki diyat sey nisf (aadhi) hai."
"5069","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kafir ki diyat momin ki diyat sey nisf (aadhi) hai."
"5070","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney maktib key barey mein , jisey qatl kar diya jaey, faisla farmaya ke jis qadr wo makatibat (likhai) ada kar chuka hai, utni azad ki diyat di jaeygi."
"5071","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney maktib key barey mein , jisey qatl kar diya jaey, faisla farmaya ke jis qadr wo makatibat (likhai) ada kar chuka hai, utni azad ki diyat di jaeygi."
"5072","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Allah key Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney makatib key barey mein faisla farmaya ke (agar wo qatl kar diya jaey to) jis qadr wo azad ho chuka hai, utni diyat azad ki di jaeygi."
"5073","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Allah key Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney makatib key barey mein faisla farmaya ke (agar wo qatl kar diya jaey to) jis qadr wo azad ho chuka hai, utni diyat azad ki di jaeygi."
"5074","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney makatib key barey mein faisla farmaya ke makatib ghulam jis qadr maale-makatibat (likhai) ada kar chuka hai, uski utni diyat azad key hisab sey di jaeygi aur baqi ghulam key lihaz sey."
"5075","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney makatib key barey mein faisla farmaya ke makatib ghulam jis qadr maale-makatibat (likhai) ada kar chuka hai, uski utni diyat azad key hisab sey di jaeygi aur baqi ghulam key lihaz sey."
"5076","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : makatib itna azad hai jis qadr wo makatibat (likhai) ada kar chuka hai aur wo jis qadr azad hai, utni is par had lagai jaeygi aur jis qadr wo azad hai, itna wo waris banega."
"5077","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : makatib itna azad hai jis qadr wo makatibat (likhai) ada kar chuka hai aur wo jis qadr azad hai, utni is par had lagai jaeygi aur jis qadr wo azad hai, itna wo waris banega."
"5078","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey manqul hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key daure mubarak main eik makatib ko qatl kar diya gaya to aap ney hukm diya ke jis qadr wo maale makatibat (likhaai) ada kar chuka hai, utney hissey ki diyat azad key hisab sey di jaey aur baqi ki ghulam key lihaz sey."
"5079","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey manqul hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key daure mubarak main eik makatib ko qatl kar diya gaya to aap ney hukm diya ke jis qadr wo maale makatibat (likhaai) ada kar chuka hai, utney hissey ki diyat azad key hisab sey di jaey aur baqi ki ghulam key lihaz sey."
"5080","Hazrat Barida (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke eik aurat ney dusri aurat ko patthar dey maara jis sey us ka hamal zaya ho gaya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us silsiley mein bachchey ki diyat pachas bakriyan muqarrar kein aur us din aap ney khazaf sey bhi mana farmaya. Abu Nuaim ney is riwayat ko mursal bayan kiya."
"5081","Hazrat Barida (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke eik aurat ney dusri aurat ko patthar dey maara jis sey us ka hamal zaya ho gaya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us silsiley mein bachchey ki diyat pachas bakriyan muqarrar kein aur us din aap ney khazaf sey bhi mana farmaya. Abu Nuaim ney is riwayat ko mursal bayan kiya."
"5082","Hazrat Abdullah bin Barida ney bayan kiya ke eik aurat ney dusri aurat ko patthar dey maara jis sey us ka hamal zaya ho gaya. ye muqadma Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key samney pesh kiya gaya to aap ney us bachchey ki diyat paanch sau bakriyan muqarrar farmaai, isi ke sath us din aap ney khazaf sey rok diya. Imam Abu-Abdur-Rehman (Nasai (Rahmatullahi Alaih)) bayan kartey hain : ye weham hai. ho sakta hai ke unka irada eik sau bakriyan kehney ka ho (lekin ghalati sey paanch-sau bakriyan keh dein). aur khazaf, yani kankari phainkney ki mumaaniat to (Abdullah bin Barida, an Abdullah bin Mughaffal) sey marwi hai (aur wo agli hadees : 4819 hi hai.)"
"5083","Hazrat Abdullah bin Barida ney bayan kiya ke eik aurat ney dusri aurat ko patthar dey maara jis sey us ka hamal zaya ho gaya. ye muqadma Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key samney pesh kiya gaya to aap ney us bachchey ki diyat paanch sau bakriyan muqarrar farmaai, isi ke sath us din aap ney khazaf sey rok diya. Imam Abu-Abdur-Rehman (Nasai (Rahmatullahi Alaih)) bayan kartey hain : ye weham hai. ho sakta hai ke unka irada eik sau bakriyan kehney ka ho (lekin ghalati sey paanch-sau bakriyan keh dein). aur khazaf, yani kankari phainkney ki mumaaniat to (Abdullah bin Barida, an Abdullah bin Mughaffal) sey marwi hai (aur wo agli hadees : 4819 hi hai.)"
"5084","Hazrat Abdullah bin Mughaffal (Raziallahu anhu) ney eik aadmi ko khazaf kartey (kankari phainktey) dekha to farmaya : khazaf na kar kyonkey Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney khazaf (kankari phainktey) sey mana farmaya hai ya aap usey napasand farmatey they. (کَھْمَس) ko shak hai."
"5085","Hazrat Abdullah bin Mughaffal (Raziallahu anhu) ney eik aadmi ko khazaf kartey (kankari phainktey) dekha to farmaya : khazaf na kar kyonkey Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney khazaf (kankari phainktey) sey mana farmaya hai ya aap usey napasand farmatey they. (کَھْمَس) ko shak hai."
"5086","Hazrat Taoos sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ney pet key bachchey ki diyat key barey mein logon sey mashwara kiya to Hazrat Hamal bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney pet key bachchey ki diyat ghurraa muqarrar farmaae hai. Hazrat Taoos ney kaha ke ghodaa bhi ghurra hai."
"5087","Hazrat Taoos sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ney pet key bachchey ki diyat key barey mein logon sey mashwara kiya to Hazrat Hamal bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney pet key bachchey ki diyat ghurraa muqarrar farmaae hai. Hazrat Taoos ney kaha ke ghodaa bhi ghurra hai."
"5088","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney banu Lihyaan ki eik aurat key pet key bachchey key barey mein jo (chot ki wajeh sey) saaqit ho kar mar gaya tha, faisla farmaya ke uski diyat ghurra hogi, yani ghulam ya londi. phir jis aurat key liye (jis key bachchey ki diyat ki baabat) ghurra ka faisla kiya tha, wo mar gaee to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney faisla farmaya ke uski virasat uskey beton aur khawind (shohar) ko milegi. aur us (qaatila) key zimmey wajibul-adaa diyat us (qaatila) key usba key zimmey hogi."
"5089","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney banu Lihyaan ki eik aurat key pet key bachchey key barey mein jo (chot ki wajeh sey) saaqit ho kar mar gaya tha, faisla farmaya ke uski diyat ghurra hogi, yani ghulam ya londi. phir jis aurat key liye (jis key bachchey ki diyat ki baabat) ghurra ka faisla kiya tha, wo mar gaee to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney faisla farmaya ke uski virasat uskey beton aur khawind (shohar) ko milegi. aur us (qaatila) key zimmey wajibul-adaa diyat us (qaatila) key usba key zimmey hogi."
"5090","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : qabila Huzail ki do aurten aapas mein lad padin. eik ney dusri ko patthar dey maara. natije ke taur par usey bhi qatl kar diya aur uskey pet key bachchey ko bhi. wo (warisen) ye jhagda Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas ley gaey to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney faisla farmaya ke pet key bachchey ki diyat ghurra hai, yani eik ghulam ya londi, isi ke sath aap ney faisla farmaya ke (qaatila) aurat key zimmey wajibul-adaa diyat uskey usba bharengey. aur aap ney us (maqtoola) ki aulad aur deegar warison ko us ka waris banaya. Hazrat Hamal bin Malik bin Naabgha Hazli ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! main kaisey us (bachchey) ki diyat bharoon jisney na piya na khaya, na bola na chillaya? is jaisa (bachcha) to zaya aur laghw (fizul aur bekar) (bila diyat) hota hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ye to kaahinon mein sey eik kaahin mehsus hota hai. (aap ney ye baat farmaae) is liye ke us ney musajja'a kalam kiya tha."
"5091","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : qabila Huzail ki do aurten aapas mein lad padin. eik ney dusri ko patthar dey maara. natije ke taur par usey bhi qatl kar diya aur uskey pet key bachchey ko bhi. wo (warisen) ye jhagda Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas ley gaey to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney faisla farmaya ke pet key bachchey ki diyat ghurra hai, yani eik ghulam ya londi, isi ke sath aap ney faisla farmaya ke (qaatila) aurat key zimmey wajibul-adaa diyat uskey usba bharengey. aur aap ney us (maqtoola) ki aulad aur deegar warison ko us ka waris banaya. Hazrat Hamal bin Malik bin Naabgha Hazli ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! main kaisey us (bachchey) ki diyat bharoon jisney na piya na khaya, na bola na chillaya? is jaisa (bachcha) to zaya aur laghw (fizul aur bekar) (bila diyat) hota hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ye to kaahinon mein sey eik kaahin mehsus hota hai. (aap ney ye baat farmaae) is liye ke us ney musajja'a kalam kiya tha."
"5092","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key daure-mubarak mein qabila Huzail ki do aurton mein sey eik ney dusri ko patthar dey maara aur us ka hamal gira diya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney uski diyat ghrra muqarrar ki, yani eik ghulam ya londi."
"5093","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key daure-mubarak mein qabila Huzail ki do aurton mein sey eik ney dusri ko patthar dey maara aur us ka hamal gira diya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney uski diyat ghrra muqarrar ki, yani eik ghulam ya londi."
"5094","Hazrat Saeed bin Musaiyab sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney pet key us bachchey ki diyat jisey walida key pet mein qatl kar diya jaey, eik ghurra muqarrar farmaae hai, yani ghulam ya londi. jis shakhs key khilaf aap ney faisla farmaya tha, wo kehney laga : main us bachchey ki diyat kaisey bharoon jisney na piya na khaya, na cheekhaa na bola? aisa bachcha to zaya aur laghw hota hai (muaawzey ka haq-daar nahin hona chahiye). Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ye to kaahin (pujaari) lagta hai."
"5095","Hazrat Saeed bin Musaiyab sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney pet key us bachchey ki diyat jisey walida key pet mein qatl kar diya jaey, eik ghurra muqarrar farmaae hai, yani ghulam ya londi. jis shakhs key khilaf aap ney faisla farmaya tha, wo kehney laga : main us bachchey ki diyat kaisey bharoon jisney na piya na khaya, na cheekhaa na bola? aisa bachcha to zaya aur laghw hota hai (muaawzey ka haq-daar nahin hona chahiye). Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ye to kaahin (pujaari) lagta hai."
"5096","Hazrat Mughira bin Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) sey marwi hai ke eik aurat ney apni saukan ko khemey ki lakdi dey maari aur usey qatl kar diya jabkey wo hamila thi. (lihaza hamal bhi zaya ho gaya). ye muqadma Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laya gaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney faisla farmaya ke qatil aurat key usba (maqtoola ki) diyat bharen, isi ke sath pet key bachchey key badley ghurra den. us aurat ka usba kehney laga : kya main aisey bachchey ki diyat dun jisney piya na khaya , cheekhaa na chillaya? aisa bachcha to kisi shumar aur qatar mein nahin hona chahiye. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ye to dehaatiyon jaisi tuk bandi karta hai."
"5097","Hazrat Mughira bin Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) sey marwi hai ke eik aurat ney apni saukan ko khemey ki lakdi dey maari aur usey qatl kar diya jabkey wo hamila thi. (lihaza hamal bhi zaya ho gaya). ye muqadma Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laya gaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney faisla farmaya ke qatil aurat key usba (maqtoola ki) diyat bharen, isi ke sath pet key bachchey key badley ghurra den. us aurat ka usba kehney laga : kya main aisey bachchey ki diyat dun jisney piya na khaya , cheekhaa na chillaya? aisa bachcha to kisi shumar aur qatar mein nahin hona chahiye. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ye to dehaatiyon jaisi tuk bandi karta hai."
"5098","Hazrat Mughira bin Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : eik aurat ney apni saukan ko khemey ka sutoon khinch maara jab ke wo hamila thi, wo mar gaee. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney maqtoola ki diyat qaatila key qaribi nasbi rishte-daaron par dal di. aur maqtoola key pet key bachchey ki diyat main eik ghurra lazim kiya. qaatila key rishte-daaron mein sey eik shakhs kehney laga : kya hum aisey bachchey ki diyat bharen jisney khaya na piya aur na choon ki? aisa bachcha to zaya aur laghw (fizul aur bekar) hota hai. aap ney farmaya : kya badduon jaisa musajja'a aur tukbandi wala kalam boltey ho? phir un par diyat laagu ki."
"5099","Hazrat Mughira bin Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : eik aurat ney apni saukan ko khemey ka sutoon khinch maara jab ke wo hamila thi, wo mar gaee. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney maqtoola ki diyat qaatila key qaribi nasbi rishte-daaron par dal di. aur maqtoola key pet key bachchey ki diyat main eik ghurra lazim kiya. qaatila key rishte-daaron mein sey eik shakhs kehney laga : kya hum aisey bachchey ki diyat bharen jisney khaya na piya aur na choon ki? aisa bachcha to zaya aur laghw (fizul aur bekar) hota hai. aap ney farmaya : kya badduon jaisa musajja'a aur tukbandi wala kalam boltey ho? phir un par diyat laagu ki."
"5100","Hazrat Mughira bin Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke do sauknon mein sey eik ney dusri ko khemey ki lakdi dey maari aur usey qatl kar diya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney diyat qaatila key nasbi rishte-daaron par dal di aur maqtoola key pet key bachchey ki diyat ghurra qarar di. erabi (dehati) kehney laga : aap mujh par aisey bachchey ki diyat dal rahey hain jisney na khaya na piya, na cheekhaa na chillaya? aisa bachcha to zaya aur laghw hota hai. aap ney farmaya : zamanae-jahiliyat jaisi musajja'a o saji hui guftoogu ki hai. aap ney pet key bachchey ki diyat ghurra muqarrar farmaae."
"5101","Hazrat Mughira bin Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke do sauknon mein sey eik ney dusri ko khemey ki lakdi dey maari aur usey qatl kar diya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney diyat qaatila key nasbi rishte-daaron par dal di aur maqtoola key pet key bachchey ki diyat ghurra qarar di. erabi (dehati) kehney laga : aap mujh par aisey bachchey ki diyat dal rahey hain jisney na khaya na piya, na cheekhaa na chillaya? aisa bachcha to zaya aur laghw hota hai. aap ney farmaya : zamanae-jahiliyat jaisi musajja'a o saji hui guftoogu ki hai. aap ney pet key bachchey ki diyat ghurra muqarrar farmaae."
"5102","Hazrat Mughira bin Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : banu Lihyan ki eik aurat ney apni saukan ko khemey ki lakdi dey maari aur usey qatl kar diya. maqtoola ko hamal tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney uski diyat qaatila key nasbi rishte-daaron par dal di aur us (maqtoola) key pet key bachchey ki diyat ghurra muqarrar farmaae."
"5103","Hazrat Mughira bin Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : banu Lihyan ki eik aurat ney apni saukan ko khemey ki lakdi dey maari aur usey qatl kar diya. maqtoola ko hamal tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney uski diyat qaatila key nasbi rishte-daaron par dal di aur us (maqtoola) key pet key bachchey ki diyat ghurra muqarrar farmaae."
"5104","Hazrat Mughira bin Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke banu Huzail key eik aadmi key nikah mein do aurten thin. eik ney dusri ko khemey ki lakdi dey maari aur uskey pet ka bacha gira diya. fareeqain jhagadtey huye Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huye. qatil ke fareeq kehney laga : hum is bachey ki kaisey diyat ada karen jisney piya na khaya, na cheekhaa na chaillaya? Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kya dehaatiyon ki tarah tuk-bandi kar rahey ho? phir aap ney ghurra (ghulam ya londi bator diyat) qatil aurat key nasbi rishte-daaron key zimmey dal di."
"5105","Hazrat Mughira bin Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke banu Huzail key eik aadmi key nikah mein do aurten thin. eik ney dusri ko khemey ki lakdi dey maari aur uskey pet ka bacha gira diya. fareeqain jhagadtey huye Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huye. qatil ke fareeq kehney laga : hum is bachey ki kaisey diyat ada karen jisney piya na khaya, na cheekhaa na chaillaya? Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kya dehaatiyon ki tarah tuk-bandi kar rahey ho? phir aap ney ghurra (ghulam ya londi bator diyat) qatil aurat key nasbi rishte-daaron key zimmey dal di."
"5106","Hazrat Mughira bin Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke banu Huzail key eik aadmi ki do biwiyan thin. eik ney dusri ko khemey ka sutoon dey maara aur us ka hamal gira diya. (jab aap ney bachchey ki diyat bayan farmaai to) aap sey kaha gaya : bataeyn to bhala jis bachchey ney na piya na khaya, na cheekhaa na chillaya (kya uski bhi diyat hogi?) aap ney farmaya : ye kya badduon jaisi tuk-bandi hai. phir aap ney uski diyat ghurra, yani eik ghulam ya londi muqarrar farmaaee aur usey aurat key nasbi rishte-daaron key zimmey dal diya. Aa'mash ney isey mursal bayan kiya hai."
"5107","Hazrat Mughira bin Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke banu Huzail key eik aadmi ki do biwiyan thin. eik ney dusri ko khemey ka sutoon dey maara aur us ka hamal gira diya. (jab aap ney bachchey ki diyat bayan farmaai to) aap sey kaha gaya : bataeyn to bhala jis bachchey ney na piya na khaya, na cheekhaa na chillaya (kya uski bhi diyat hogi?) aap ney farmaya : ye kya badduon jaisi tuk-bandi hai. phir aap ney uski diyat ghurra, yani eik ghulam ya londi muqarrar farmaaee aur usey aurat key nasbi rishte-daaron key zimmey dal diya. Aa'mash ney isey mursal bayan kiya hai."
"5108","Hazrat Ibrahim sey manqul hai ke eik aurat ney apni saukan ko patthar maara jabkey wo Hamila thi jis sey wo mar gaee to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney uskey pet key bachchey ki diyat ghurra (ghulam ya londi) muqarrar farmaae aur maqtoola ki diyat qaatila key nasbi rishte-daaron key zimmey dal di. unhoney kaha : hum aisey bachchey ki diyat bharen jisney piya na khaya, na choon-chaan ki? aisey bachchey ka to koi moawza nahin hona chahiye. aap ney farmaya : badduon ki tarah tuk-bandi kartey ho? asal hukm wohi hai jo main kehta hun."
"5109","Hazrat Ibrahim sey manqul hai ke eik aurat ney apni saukan ko patthar maara jabkey wo Hamila thi jis sey wo mar gaee to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney uskey pet key bachchey ki diyat ghurra (ghulam ya londi) muqarrar farmaae aur maqtoola ki diyat qaatila key nasbi rishte-daaron key zimmey dal di. unhoney kaha : hum aisey bachchey ki diyat bharen jisney piya na khaya, na choon-chaan ki? aisey bachchey ka to koi moawza nahin hona chahiye. aap ney farmaya : badduon ki tarah tuk-bandi kartey ho? asal hukm wohi hai jo main kehta hun."
"5110","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : do saukanein thin. un mein jhagda ho gaya. eik ney dusri ko patthar dey maara aur uskey pet ka bachcha gira diya jo murda tha. uskey baal ug chukey they. aur aurat bhi mar gaee. aap ney qaatila key nasbi rishte-daaron par diyat dal di. maqtoola key chacha ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! is ney bachcha bhi zaya kiya hai jis key baal ug chukey they. qaatila key walid ney kaha : ye jhoot boltaa hai. Allah ki qism ! ye bachcha na cheekhaa, chillaya, na us ney piya na khaya. aisa to zaya aur batil hota hai. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kya jahilon aur kaahinon jaisi saja' (tuk-bandi) kar raha hai? is bachchey mein bhi ghurra aayega. Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : eik aurat ka naam Muleka aur dusri ka Ummey Ghateef tha."
"5111","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : do saukanein thin. un mein jhagda ho gaya. eik ney dusri ko patthar dey maara aur uskey pet ka bachcha gira diya jo murda tha. uskey baal ug chukey they. aur aurat bhi mar gaee. aap ney qaatila key nasbi rishte-daaron par diyat dal di. maqtoola key chacha ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! is ney bachcha bhi zaya kiya hai jis key baal ug chukey they. qaatila key walid ney kaha : ye jhoot boltaa hai. Allah ki qism ! ye bachcha na cheekhaa, chillaya, na us ney piya na khaya. aisa to zaya aur batil hota hai. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kya jahilon aur kaahinon jaisi saja' (tuk-bandi) kar raha hai? is bachchey mein bhi ghurra aayega. Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : eik aurat ka naam Muleka aur dusri ka Ummey Ghateef tha."
"5112","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney ye tehreer likhwaai ke har qabiley ko apney logon par aaid-shuda deyaten deni hongi, isi ke sath kisi azad shuda ghulam key liye jayez nahin ke wo apney Mola ki ijazat key baghair kisi aur musalman ko Mola bana ley."
"5113","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney ye tehreer likhwaai ke har qabiley ko apney logon par aaid-shuda deyaten deni hongi, isi ke sath kisi azad shuda ghulam key liye jayez nahin ke wo apney Mola ki ijazat key baghair kisi aur musalman ko Mola bana ley."
"5114","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib key pardada sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs aisey hi tabeeb (doctor) ban kar ilaj kerey. halanke (is sey qabl ) wo mustanad tabeeb nahin tha to (agar koi nuqsan ho jaey) wo zaamin (zimme-daar) hoga."
"5115","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib key pardada sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs aisey hi tabeeb (doctor) ban kar ilaj kerey. halanke (is sey qabl ) wo mustanad tabeeb nahin tha to (agar koi nuqsan ho jaey) wo zaamin (zimme-daar) hoga."
"5116","حدثنا أبو سعيد الخدري، قال: \قال النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم: 'امرأة من بني إسرائيل خذت خاتما من ذهب ملؤه مسك، فقال النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم: إن ذلك خير النظائر'\""\n Narrated by Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri: \""The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said: 'A woman from among the Children of Israel took a ring of gold and filled it with musk.' The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said: 'That is the best kind of perfume.\"""""""
"5117","حدثنا أبو Hurيرة، قال: \قال النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم لمن جاء به خلة قليلة: 'اذهب واغسلها'، ثم جاء فقال: 'اذهب واغسلها'، ثم جاء إليه فقال: 'اذهب واغسلها'\""\n Narrated by Abu Hurairah: \""A man came to the Prophet [SAW] wearing a little dab of Khaluq. The Prophet [SAW] said to him: 'Go and scrub it off.' Then he came (again) and he said: 'Go and scrub it off.' Then he came to him (again) and he said: 'Go and scrub it off.\"""""""
"5118","Hazrat Abu Ramsa (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : main Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas apney walid key sath hazir huwa. aap ney (merey walid sey) farmaya : ye terey sath kon hai? unhoney kaha : main gawahi deta hun, ye mera beta hai. aap ney farmaya : khabrdar ! terey jurm ka ye zimme-daar nahin aur to iskey jurm ka zimme-daar nahin."
"5119","Hazrat Abu Ramsa (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : main Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas apney walid key sath hazir huwa. aap ney (merey walid sey) farmaya : ye terey sath kon hai? unhoney kaha : main gawahi deta hun, ye mera beta hai. aap ney farmaya : khabrdar ! terey jurm ka ye zimme-daar nahin aur to iskey jurm ka zimme-daar nahin."
"5120","Hazrat Solba bin Zehdam Yurbui (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ansaar key eik giroh mein khitab farma rahey they. ansaar kehney lagey : un banu Solba bin Yurbuaa ney jahiliyat mein falan shakhs ko qatl kar diya tha. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney aawaz buland kartey huye farmaya : aagah raho ! koi shakhs kisi dusrey key jurm ka zimme-daar nahin."
"5121","Hazrat Solba bin Zehdam Yurbui (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ansaar key eik giroh mein khitab farma rahey they. ansaar kehney lagey : un banu Solba bin Yurbuaa ney jahiliyat mein falan shakhs ko qatl kar diya tha. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney aawaz buland kartey huye farmaya : aagah raho ! koi shakhs kisi dusrey key jurm ka zimme-daar nahin."
"5122","Hazrat Solba bin Zehdam (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : bano Solba key kuchh log Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas pahunchey jabkey aap khitab farma rahey they. eik aadmi ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! in banu Solba bin Yurbuaa ney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key falan sahabi ko qatl kiya tha. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kisi shakhs key jurm ka koi doosra shakhs zimme-daar nahin hota."
"5123","Hazrat Solba bin Zehdam (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : bano Solba key kuchh log Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas pahunchey jabkey aap khitab farma rahey they. eik aadmi ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! in banu Solba bin Yurbuaa ney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key falan sahabi ko qatl kiya tha. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kisi shakhs key jurm ka koi doosra shakhs zimme-daar nahin hota."
"5124","banu Solba bin Yurbuaa (qabiley) main sey eik shakhs sey riwayat hai ke banu Solba key kuchh log Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaye to eik aadmi ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! in banu Solba bin Yurbuaa ney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key falan sahabi ko qatl kiya tha. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : koi shakhs kisi dusrey key jurm ka zimme-daar nahin."
"5125","banu Solba bin Yurbuaa (qabiley) main sey eik shakhs sey riwayat hai ke banu Solba key kuchh log Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaye to eik aadmi ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! in banu Solba bin Yurbuaa ney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key falan sahabi ko qatl kiya tha. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : koi shakhs kisi dusrey key jurm ka zimme-daar nahin."
"5126","banu Solba bin Yurbuaa key eik shakhs sey riwayat hai ke banu Solba key kuchh logon ney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key eik sahabi ko qatl kar diya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key eik sahabi ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! ye banu Solba hain. unhoney falan (sahabi) ko qatl kiya tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kisi shakhs ka jurm kisi dusrey key naam nahin lag sakta. (raawi hadees) Shoba ney kaha : yani kisi ko kisi aur shakhs key jurm mein giraftar nahin kiya ja sakta. (wallahu-aalam)."
"5127","banu Solba bin Yurbuaa key eik shakhs sey riwayat hai ke banu Solba key kuchh logon ney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key eik sahabi ko qatl kar diya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key eik sahabi ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! ye banu Solba hain. unhoney falan (sahabi) ko qatl kiya tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kisi shakhs ka jurm kisi dusrey key naam nahin lag sakta. (raawi hadees) Shoba ney kaha : yani kisi ko kisi aur shakhs key jurm mein giraftar nahin kiya ja sakta. (wallahu-aalam)."
"5128","banu Solba bin Yurbuaa key eik aadmi sey riwayat hai ke main Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas hazir huwa jabkey aap khitab farma rahey they. eik aadmi ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! in banu Solba bin Yurbuaa ney falan shakhs (sahabi Rasool) ko qatl kiya tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : nahin. yani kisi shakhs ka jurm kisi dusrey par nahin dala ja sakta."
"5129","banu Solba bin Yurbuaa key eik aadmi sey riwayat hai ke main Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas hazir huwa jabkey aap khitab farma rahey they. eik aadmi ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! in banu Solba bin Yurbuaa ney falan shakhs (sahabi Rasool) ko qatl kiya tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : nahin. yani kisi shakhs ka jurm kisi dusrey par nahin dala ja sakta."
"5130","bani Yurbuaa key eik aadmi ney kaha : hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas pahunchey to aap logon sey khitab farma rahey they. (hamein dekh kar) kuchh log khadey ho gaey aur kehney lagey : aey Allah key Rasool ! ye falan qabiley key log hain. inhoney falan sahabi ko qatl kiya tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kisi eik shakhs ka jurm dusrey key zimmey nahin lagaya ja sakta."
"5131","bani Yurbuaa key eik aadmi ney kaha : hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas pahunchey to aap logon sey khitab farma rahey they. (hamein dekh kar) kuchh log khadey ho gaey aur kehney lagey : aey Allah key Rasool ! ye falan qabiley key log hain. inhoney falan sahabi ko qatl kiya tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kisi eik shakhs ka jurm dusrey key zimmey nahin lagaya ja sakta."
"5132","Hazrat Taariq Mahaaribi (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! ye banu Solba hain jinhoney apney daure-jahiliyat mein falan ko qatl kiya tha. in sey hamein qisaas dilwa dijiye. aap ney apney haath mubarak uthaey yahan tak ke mainey aap ki baghlon ki safedi dekhi. aap ney do dafa farmaya : kisi maa ka jurm uskey betey key galey nahin padta."
"5133","Hazrat Taariq Mahaaribi (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! ye banu Solba hain jinhoney apney daure-jahiliyat mein falan ko qatl kiya tha. in sey hamein qisaas dilwa dijiye. aap ney apney haath mubarak uthaey yahan tak ke mainey aap ki baghlon ki safedi dekhi. aap ney do dafa farmaya : kisi maa ka jurm uskey betey key galey nahin padta."
"5134","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib key pardada (Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu) ) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney faisla farmaya ke jo kaani (be Noor) aankh apni jagah qaaim ho, agar phod di jaey to aankh ki eik tihai diyat di jaeygi. aur be-jaan haath agar kaat diya jaey to haath ki tihai diyat dey di jaeygi. aur wo daant jo siyah ho chuka ho, ukhaad diya jaey to daant ki tihai diyat hogi."
"5135","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib key pardada (Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu) ) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney faisla farmaya ke jo kaani (be Noor) aankh apni jagah qaaim ho, agar phod di jaey to aankh ki eik tihai diyat di jaeygi. aur be-jaan haath agar kaat diya jaey to haath ki tihai diyat dey di jaeygi. aur wo daant jo siyah ho chuka ho, ukhaad diya jaey to daant ki tihai diyat hogi."
"5136","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib key pardada sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : daanton mein paanch oont hain. yani har daant ki diyat paanch oont hai."
"5137","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib key pardada sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : daanton mein paanch oont hain. yani har daant ki diyat paanch oont hai."
"5138","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib key pardada sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : sab daant (diyat mein) barabar hain. yani har eik mein paanch paanch oont."
"5139","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib key pardada sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : sab daant (diyat mein) barabar hain. yani har eik mein paanch paanch oont."
"5140","حدثنا عائشة، قال: \رأى النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم خاتمين من ذهب على يديها فقال: 'ألا أخبركم بخير من هذا؟ لم تزعيما هذه الخاتمين وارتديا خاتمين من فضة'\""\n Narrated by 'Aishah: The Messenger of Allah [SAW] saw her wearing two bracelets of gold. The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said: 'Shall I not tell you of something that is better than this? Why don't you take these off and wear two bracelets of silver.\"""""""
"5141","Hazrat Abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ungliyon mein (har ungli key) das-das oont hain."
"5142","Hazrat Abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) sey manqul hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ungliyan sab barabar hain."
"5143","Hazrat Abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) sey manqul hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ungliyan sab barabar hain."
"5144","Hazrat Abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney faisla farmaya ke ungliyan sab barabar hain. (har eik ki diyat ) das das oont hai."
"5145","Hazrat Abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney faisla farmaya ke ungliyan sab barabar hain. (har eik ki diyat ) das das oont hai."
"5146","Hazrat Saeed bin Musaiyab sey riwayat hai ke jab mainey wo dastawez dekhi jo Amr bin Hazam (Raziallahu anhu) ki aulad key paas thi aur jis key barey mein unka daawey tha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney ye tehreer khud likhwa kar in ko di, is mein ye bhi likha tha ke ungliyon ki diyat das das oont hai."
"5147","Hazrat Saeed bin Musaiyab sey riwayat hai ke jab mainey wo dastawez dekhi jo Amr bin Hazam (Raziallahu anhu) ki aulad key paas thi aur jis key barey mein unka daawey tha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney ye tehreer khud likhwa kar in ko di, is mein ye bhi likha tha ke ungliyon ki diyat das das oont hai."
"5148","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ye aur ye barabar hain. yani angoothaa aur chhanguli."
"5149","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ye aur ye barabar hain. yani angoothaa aur chhanguli."
"5150","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey marwi (riwayat hui) hai ke ye aur ye,  (yani) angoothaa aur chhanguli (diyat key lihaz sey) barabar hain."
"5151","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey marwi (riwayat hui) hai ke ye aur ye,  (yani) angoothaa aur chhanguli (diyat key lihaz sey) barabar hain."
"5152","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : sab ungliyon ki diyat das das oont hai."
"5153","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : sab ungliyon ki diyat das das oont hai."
"5154","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Makka Mukarrama fatah kiya to apney khutbey mein irshad farmaya : ungliyon ki diyat das das oont hai."
"5155","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Makka Mukarrama fatah kiya to apney khutbey mein irshad farmaya : ungliyon ki diyat das das oont hai."
"5156","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib apney baap sey, wo (Shoaib) apney dada sey bayan kartey hain ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney apney khutbey mein farmaya jab ke aap ney Kaabe key sath apni pusht ki tek laga rakhi thi : tamam ungliyan (diyat key lihaz sey) barabar hain."
"5157","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib apney baap sey, wo (Shoaib) apney dada sey bayan kartey hain ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney apney khutbey mein farmaya jab ke aap ney Kaabe key sath apni pusht ki tek laga rakhi thi : tamam ungliyan (diyat key lihaz sey) barabar hain."
"5158","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Makka Mukarrama fatah kiya to apney khutbey mein irshad farmaya : haddi ko nangaa kar deney waley zakhmon mein diyat paanch paanch oont hai."
"5159","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Makka Mukarrama fatah kiya to apney khutbey mein irshad farmaya : haddi ko nangaa kar deney waley zakhmon mein diyat paanch paanch oont hai."
"5160","Hazrat Amr bin Hazam (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Yamen walon ki taraf eik tehreer likhwa kar bheji jis mein faraaiz aur sunan aur diyat key masaayel they. aap ney wo tehreer Amr bin Hazam key haath bheji thi. wo ehale-Yamen ko padh kar sunai gaee. uski ibarat yun thi : ye tehreer Nabi Akram Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki taraf sey Shurehbil bin Abd Kulaal, Nuaim bin Abd Kulaal aur Haris bin Abd Kulaal ki taraf hai, jo Zu-ruain, Muaafir aur Hamdaan key sardar hain. Amma-baad ! (us tehreer mein bahut si baaten thin ) us tehreer mein ye baat bhi thi ke jo shakhs kisi momin ko be gunah qatl kar dey aur gawah mojud hon to us ko qisas ke taur par qatl kar diya jaeyga siwaey iske ke maqtool key warison razi ho jaeyn. aur har insani jaan ki diyat sau oont hai. agar puri naak kaat di jaey to is mein mukammal diyat (sau oont) hogi. zaban puri kaat di jaey to is mein bhi puri diyat hogi. dono hont kaatey janey ki surat mein bhi puri diyat hogi. khasiyatein mukammal kaat diye jaeyn to puri diyat hogi. zikr pura kaat diya jaey to puri diyat hogi. kamar (reedh) ki haddi tod di jaey to puri diyat hogi. dono aankhen phod ya nikal di jaeyn to puri diyat hogi. eik paon ki nisf (aadhi) diyat hogi. dimagh tak pahunch janey waley zakham mein tihai diyat hogi. pet key andar tak pahunch janey waley zakham mein tihai diyat hogi. haddi ko tod deney waley zakham ki diyat pandarah oont hongey. haath paon ki ungliyon mein sey har ungli ki diyat das oont hogi. har daant ki diyat paanch oont hogi. haddi ko nangaa karney waley zakham ki diyat paanch oont hogi. aadmi aurat ko qatl karey to usey qatl kar diya jaeyga. agar koi shakhs soney ki surat mein diyat dena chahey to diyat eik hazar deenar hogi. Muhammad bin Bakkaar bin Bilal ney Hukm bin Musa ki mukhalifat ki hai."
"5161","Hazrat Amr bin Hazam (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Yamen walon ki taraf eik tehreer likhwa kar bheji jis mein faraaiz aur sunan aur diyat key masaayel they. aap ney wo tehreer Amr bin Hazam key haath bheji thi. wo ehale-Yamen ko padh kar sunai gaee. uski ibarat yun thi : ye tehreer Nabi Akram Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki taraf sey Shurehbil bin Abd Kulaal, Nuaim bin Abd Kulaal aur Haris bin Abd Kulaal ki taraf hai, jo Zu-ruain, Muaafir aur Hamdaan key sardar hain. Amma-baad ! (us tehreer mein bahut si baaten thin ) us tehreer mein ye baat bhi thi ke jo shakhs kisi momin ko be gunah qatl kar dey aur gawah mojud hon to us ko qisas ke taur par qatl kar diya jaeyga siwaey iske ke maqtool key warison razi ho jaeyn. aur har insani jaan ki diyat sau oont hai. agar puri naak kaat di jaey to is mein mukammal diyat (sau oont) hogi. zaban puri kaat di jaey to is mein bhi puri diyat hogi. dono hont kaatey janey ki surat mein bhi puri diyat hogi. khasiyatein mukammal kaat diye jaeyn to puri diyat hogi. zikr pura kaat diya jaey to puri diyat hogi. kamar (reedh) ki haddi tod di jaey to puri diyat hogi. dono aankhen phod ya nikal di jaeyn to puri diyat hogi. eik paon ki nisf (aadhi) diyat hogi. dimagh tak pahunch janey waley zakham mein tihai diyat hogi. pet key andar tak pahunch janey waley zakham mein tihai diyat hogi. haddi ko tod deney waley zakham ki diyat pandarah oont hongey. haath paon ki ungliyon mein sey har ungli ki diyat das oont hogi. har daant ki diyat paanch oont hogi. haddi ko nangaa karney waley zakham ki diyat paanch oont hogi. aadmi aurat ko qatl karey to usey qatl kar diya jaeyga. agar koi shakhs soney ki surat mein diyat dena chahey to diyat eik hazar deenar hogi. Muhammad bin Bakkaar bin Bilal ney Hukm bin Musa ki mukhalifat ki hai."
"5162","Hazrat Amr bin Hazam (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Yamen walon ki taraf eik tehreer likh kar bheji jis mein faraaiz aur sunan aur diyat key masaayel they. aap ney ye tehreer Hazrat Amr bin Hazam key haath bheji thi aur ye Yamen walon ko padh kar sunai gaee. ye us ka mazmoon hai. phir raawi ney sabiqa riwayat ki tarah bayan kiya magar us ney kaha : eik aankh mein nisf (aadhi) diyat (pachas oont) hai. eik haath mein nisf (aadhi) diyat hai aur eik paon mein nisf (aadhi) diyat hai. Imam Abu Abdur-Rehman (Nasai (Rahmatullahi Alaih)) bayan kartey hain ke ye riwayat durust honey key ziyada qarib hai. (wallahu-aalam ! ) aur Suleman (Alaihissalam) bin Arqam matrukul-hadees hai. aur yehi riwayat Yunus (bin Yazid) ney Imam Zohri (Rahmatullahi Alaih) sey mursalan bayan ki hai jaisa ke darija-zail (ye likhi hui) riwayat hai."
"5163","Hazrat Amr bin Hazam (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Yamen walon ki taraf eik tehreer likh kar bheji jis mein faraaiz aur sunan aur diyat key masaayel they. aap ney ye tehreer Hazrat Amr bin Hazam key haath bheji thi aur ye Yamen walon ko padh kar sunai gaee. ye us ka mazmoon hai. phir raawi ney sabiqa riwayat ki tarah bayan kiya magar us ney kaha : eik aankh mein nisf (aadhi) diyat (pachas oont) hai. eik haath mein nisf (aadhi) diyat hai aur eik paon mein nisf (aadhi) diyat hai. Imam Abu Abdur-Rehman (Nasai (Rahmatullahi Alaih)) bayan kartey hain ke ye riwayat durust honey key ziyada qarib hai. (wallahu-aalam ! ) aur Suleman (Alaihissalam) bin Arqam matrukul-hadees hai. aur yehi riwayat Yunus (bin Yazid) ney Imam Zohri (Rahmatullahi Alaih) sey mursalan bayan ki hai jaisa ke darija-zail (ye likhi hui) riwayat hai."
"5164","Hazrat ibne-Shahab (Zohri) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki wo tehreer padhi hai jo aap ney Hazrat Amr bin Hazam (Raziallahu anhu) ko Najran ka Haakim banatey waqt likh kar di thi. ye tehreer Hazrat Abu-Bakar bin Hazam key paas thi. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney likha tha ke ye Allah Taala aur uskey Rasool ki taraf sey (ehkam ka) bayan hai : aey eman walo ! ehad purey karo. phir aap ney chand aayaat likhin. yahan tak ke yahan tak pahunchey : (ان اللہ سریع الحساب),''be shak Allah bahut jald hisab leney wala hai.''phir aap ney tehreer farmaya tha ke ye zakhmon waghera (ki diyat) key barey main eik tehreer hai. jaan (khatam kar deney ki soorat) main diyat sau oont hogi. baqi pichhli riwayat ke hisab se hai."
"5165","Hazrat ibne-Shahab (Zohri) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki wo tehreer padhi hai jo aap ney Hazrat Amr bin Hazam (Raziallahu anhu) ko Najran ka Haakim banatey waqt likh kar di thi. ye tehreer Hazrat Abu-Bakar bin Hazam key paas thi. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney likha tha ke ye Allah Taala aur uskey Rasool ki taraf sey (ehkam ka) bayan hai : aey eman walo ! ehad purey karo. phir aap ney chand aayaat likhin. yahan tak ke yahan tak pahunchey : (ان اللہ سریع الحساب),''be shak Allah bahut jald hisab leney wala hai.''phir aap ney tehreer farmaya tha ke ye zakhmon waghera (ki diyat) key barey main eik tehreer hai. jaan (khatam kar deney ki soorat) main diyat sau oont hogi. baqi pichhli riwayat ke hisab se hai."
"5166","Hazrat Zohri (Rahmatullahi Alaih) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : merey paas Hazrat Abu-Bakar bin Hazam Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki tehreer ley kar aaye jo chamdey key tukdey par likhi hui thi ke ye Allah Taala aur uskey Rasool ki taraf sey (ehkam ka) bayan hai : aey eman walo ! ehad purey karo. phir uskey baad kaee aayaten padhin phir kaha : (phir likha tha) kisi jaan ko khatam kar deney ki surat mein diyat sau oont hogi. eik haath mein pachas oont hain. eik aankh mein (aankh ki diyat) pachas oont hain aur eik paon ki diyat bhi pachas oont hain. dimagh tak pahunch janey waley zakham mein tihai diyat hai. aur pet key andar tak pahunch janey waley zakham ki diyat bhi eik tihai hai. haddi ko tod deney waley zakham mein pandarah oont diyat hai. ungliyon ki diyat das das oont hai. daanton ki diyat paanch paanch oont hai. aur haddi ko nangaa karney waley zakham mein paanch oont diyat hai."
"5167","Hazrat Zohri (Rahmatullahi Alaih) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : merey paas Hazrat Abu-Bakar bin Hazam Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki tehreer ley kar aaye jo chamdey key tukdey par likhi hui thi ke ye Allah Taala aur uskey Rasool ki taraf sey (ehkam ka) bayan hai : aey eman walo ! ehad purey karo. phir uskey baad kaee aayaten padhin phir kaha : (phir likha tha) kisi jaan ko khatam kar deney ki surat mein diyat sau oont hogi. eik haath mein pachas oont hain. eik aankh mein (aankh ki diyat) pachas oont hain aur eik paon ki diyat bhi pachas oont hain. dimagh tak pahunch janey waley zakham mein tihai diyat hai. aur pet key andar tak pahunch janey waley zakham ki diyat bhi eik tihai hai. haddi ko tod deney waley zakham mein pandarah oont diyat hai. ungliyon ki diyat das das oont hai. daanton ki diyat paanch paanch oont hai. aur haddi ko nangaa karney waley zakham mein paanch oont diyat hai."
"5168","Hazrat Abu-Bakar bin Muhammad bin Amr bin Hazam sey riwayat hai ke wo tehreer jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney diyat key masaayel key barey mein Hazrat Amr bin Hazam (Raziallahu anhu) ko likh kar di thi. (yun hai ke) jaan (khatam kar deney ki soorat) main sau oont diyat hai. aur naak mein, jab wo jad sey kaat di jaey, bhi sau oont diyat hai. aur dimagh tak pahunch janey waley zakham mein kul diyat ka eik tihai hai. aur pet key andar pahunch janey waley zakham mein bhi tihai diyat hi hai. eik haath mein pachas oont diyat hai. aur eik aankh mein bhi pachas oont hain aur eik paon mein bhi pachas oont hain. aur (haath paon ki) har ungli mein das oont diyat hai. har daant mein paanch oont hain aur haddi ko nangaa kar deney waley zakham mein bhi paanch oont diyat hai."
"5169","Hazrat Abu-Bakar bin Muhammad bin Amr bin Hazam sey riwayat hai ke wo tehreer jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney diyat key masaayel key barey mein Hazrat Amr bin Hazam (Raziallahu anhu) ko likh kar di thi. (yun hai ke) jaan (khatam kar deney ki soorat) main sau oont diyat hai. aur naak mein, jab wo jad sey kaat di jaey, bhi sau oont diyat hai. aur dimagh tak pahunch janey waley zakham mein kul diyat ka eik tihai hai. aur pet key andar pahunch janey waley zakham mein bhi tihai diyat hi hai. eik haath mein pachas oont diyat hai. aur eik aankh mein bhi pachas oont hain aur eik paon mein bhi pachas oont hain. aur (haath paon ki) har ungli mein das oont diyat hai. har daant mein paanch oont hain aur haddi ko nangaa kar deney waley zakham mein bhi paanch oont diyat hai."
"5170","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke eik erabi (dehati) Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key darwazey key paas aaya aur us ney apni aankh darwazey key surakh par laga di. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us ko dekh liya aur aap eik tez dhaar wali chiz ya eik (nauk-daar) lakdi ley kar uski taraf chaley taake uski aankh phod den. jab us ney aap ko (aatey) dekha to aankh peechhey hata li. (peechhey hat gaya) Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney usey (ghussey key sath ) farmaya : agar to isi tarah khada rehta to main teri aankh phod deta."
"5171","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke eik erabi (dehati) Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key darwazey key paas aaya aur us ney apni aankh darwazey key surakh par laga di. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us ko dekh liya aur aap eik tez dhaar wali chiz ya eik (nauk-daar) lakdi ley kar uski taraf chaley taake uski aankh phod den. jab us ney aap ko (aatey) dekha to aankh peechhey hata li. (peechhey hat gaya) Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney usey (ghussey key sath ) farmaya : agar to isi tarah khada rehta to main teri aankh phod deta."
"5172","Hazrat Sahal bin Saad Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) ney khabar di ke eik aadmi Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key darwazey key surakh sey jhankney laga. aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas eik naukdaar lakdi thi jis sey aap apney sar ko khujli farma rahey they. jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us ko dekha to farmaya : agar mujhey ilm hota ke to mujhey dekh raha hai to main ye lakdi teri aankh mein maar deta. ijazat leney ka hukm to isi liye diya gaya hai ke nazar na pad sakey."
"5173","Hazrat Sahal bin Saad Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) ney khabar di ke eik aadmi Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key darwazey key surakh sey jhankney laga. aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas eik naukdaar lakdi thi jis sey aap apney sar ko khujli farma rahey they. jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us ko dekha to farmaya : agar mujhey ilm hota ke to mujhey dekh raha hai to main ye lakdi teri aankh mein maar deta. ijazat leney ka hukm to isi liye diya gaya hai ke nazar na pad sakey."
"5174","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs kisi key ghar mein baghair ijazat liye jhaankney lagey aur wo uski aankh phod den to us ko diyat milegi na qisaas."
"5175","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs kisi key ghar mein baghair ijazat liye jhaankney lagey aur wo uski aankh phod den to us ko diyat milegi na qisaas."
"5176","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : agar koi shakhs tujhey baghair ijazat jhaankney lagey aur to kankari waghera maar kar uski aankh phod dey to tujh par koi tawaan (jurmaana) aur gunah aaid nahin hoga."
"5177","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : agar koi shakhs tujhey baghair ijazat jhaankney lagey aur to kankari waghera maar kar uski aankh phod dey to tujh par koi tawaan (jurmaana) aur gunah aaid nahin hoga."
"5178","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke wo namaz padh rahey they. itney mein Hazrat Marwan ka eik beta unkey aagey sey guzarney laga. unhoney us ko peechhey dhakela lekin wo peechhey na hata to unhoney usey maara. wo rotaa huwa chala gaya yahan tak ke Hazrat Marwan key paas pahunch gaya aur ja kar unhein bataya. Hazrat Marwan ney Hazrat Abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) sey kaha : aap ney apney bhateejey (merey betey) ko kyon maara hai? unhoney kaha : mainey us ko nahin maara. mainey to shetan ko maara hai. mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna hai : jab tum mein sey koi shakhs namaz padh raha ho aur koi doosra shakhs uskey aagey sey guzarnaa chahey to wo apni taqat ki had tak usey rokney ki koshish kerey. agar wo (rukney sey) inkar kar dey (aur rokney key bawajud phir bhi guzarney par Misr rahey) to us sey ladey kyonkey wo shetan hai."
"5179","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke wo namaz padh rahey they. itney mein Hazrat Marwan ka eik beta unkey aagey sey guzarney laga. unhoney us ko peechhey dhakela lekin wo peechhey na hata to unhoney usey maara. wo rotaa huwa chala gaya yahan tak ke Hazrat Marwan key paas pahunch gaya aur ja kar unhein bataya. Hazrat Marwan ney Hazrat Abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) sey kaha : aap ney apney bhateejey (merey betey) ko kyon maara hai? unhoney kaha : mainey us ko nahin maara. mainey to shetan ko maara hai. mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna hai : jab tum mein sey koi shakhs namaz padh raha ho aur koi doosra shakhs uskey aagey sey guzarnaa chahey to wo apni taqat ki had tak usey rokney ki koshish kerey. agar wo (rukney sey) inkar kar dey (aur rokney key bawajud phir bhi guzarney par Misr rahey) to us sey ladey kyonkey wo shetan hai."
"5180","Hazrat Saeed bin Juber bayan kartey hain ke mujhey Hazrat Abdur-Rehman bin Abzi (Raziallahu anhu) ney hukm diya ke main Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey un do aayaat key barey mein poochhun : (وَ مَنْ یَّقْتُلْ مُؤْمِنًا مُّتَعَمِّدًا),''jo shakhs kisi momin ko jaan boojh kar qatl kar dey, uski saza jahannam hai.'' ''Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : is aayat ko kisi dusri aayat ney mansookh nahin kiya. dusri aayat ye thi : (وَالَّذِیْنَ لَا یَدْعُوْنَ مَعَ"
"5181","Hazrat Saeed bin Juber bayan kartey hain ke mujhey Hazrat Abdur-Rehman bin Abzi (Raziallahu anhu) ney hukm diya ke main Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey un do aayaat key barey mein poochhun : (وَ مَنْ یَّقْتُلْ مُؤْمِنًا مُّتَعَمِّدًا),''jo shakhs kisi momin ko jaan boojh kar qatl kar dey, uski saza jahannam hai.'' ''Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : is aayat ko kisi dusri aayat ney mansookh nahin kiya. dusri aayat ye thi : (وَالَّذِیْنَ لَا یَدْعُوْنَ مَعَ"
"5182","Hazrat Saeed bin Juber sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Kufaa walon ka is aayat key barey mein ikhtilaf ho gaya : (وَ مَنْ یَّقْتُلْ مُؤْمِنًا مُّتَعَمِّدًا),''jo shakhs kisi momin ko jaan boojh kar qatl kerey.'' mainey Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf kooch kiya aur un sey ye masla puchha to unhoney farmaya : ye aayat aakhiri nazil honey wali aayaat mein shamil hai. is ko kisi aur aayat ney mansookh nahin kiya."
"5183","Hazrat Saeed bin Juber sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Kufaa walon ka is aayat key barey mein ikhtilaf ho gaya : (وَ مَنْ یَّقْتُلْ مُؤْمِنًا مُّتَعَمِّدًا),''jo shakhs kisi momin ko jaan boojh kar qatl kerey.'' mainey Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf kooch kiya aur un sey ye masla puchha to unhoney farmaya : ye aayat aakhiri nazil honey wali aayaat mein shamil hai. is ko kisi aur aayat ney mansookh nahin kiya."
"5184","Hazrat Saeed bin Juber sey riwayat hai ke mainey Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey puchha ke jo shakhs kisi momin ko jaan boojh kar qatl kar dey, kya uski tauba qubul ho sakti hai? unhoney farmaya : nahin. mainey Sura furqan wali aayat padhi : (وَالَّذِیْنَ لَا یَدْعُوْنَ . . . . . ),''woh log jo Allah Taala key sath kisi ko mabood nahin banatey aur na kisi qabile-ehtiraam jaan ko nahaq qatl kartey hain magar haq key sath.'' unhoney farmaya : ye aayat Makki daur mein utri. is ko Madina Munawra mein utarney wali eik aayat ney mansookh kar diya : (وَ مَنْ یَّقْتُلْ مُؤْمِنًا"
"5185","Hazrat Saeed bin Juber sey riwayat hai ke mainey Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey puchha ke jo shakhs kisi momin ko jaan boojh kar qatl kar dey, kya uski tauba qubul ho sakti hai? unhoney farmaya : nahin. mainey Sura furqan wali aayat padhi : (وَالَّذِیْنَ لَا یَدْعُوْنَ . . . . . ),''woh log jo Allah Taala key sath kisi ko mabood nahin banatey aur na kisi qabile-ehtiraam jaan ko nahaq qatl kartey hain magar haq key sath.'' unhoney farmaya : ye aayat Makki daur mein utri. is ko Madina Munawra mein utarney wali eik aayat ney mansookh kar diya : (وَ مَنْ یَّقْتُلْ مُؤْمِنًا"
"5186","Hazrat Salim bin Abul-Ja'd (Rahmatullahi Alaih) sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey us shakhs key barey mein puchha gaya jo kisi momin shakhs ko jaan boojh kar qatl kar dey. phir tauba kerey. eman ley aaye aur nek amal shuru kar dey. phir raahe-raast par aa jaey. (kya uski tauba qubul hai?) Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : uskey liye tauba ki gunjaaish kaisey ho sakti hai? mainey tumharey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna hai : maqtool qatil ko pakad kar layega jab ke maqtool ki ragon sey khoon beh raha hoga aur wo keh raha hoga : ya-Allah ! is sey poochh, is ney mujhey kis bina par qatl kiya? phir farmaya : Allah ki qism ! ye (pichhli hadees mein mazkur) aayat Allah Taala ney utaari hai aur isey mansookh nahin farmaya."
"5187","Hazrat Salim bin Abul-Ja'd (Rahmatullahi Alaih) sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey us shakhs key barey mein puchha gaya jo kisi momin shakhs ko jaan boojh kar qatl kar dey. phir tauba kerey. eman ley aaye aur nek amal shuru kar dey. phir raahe-raast par aa jaey. (kya uski tauba qubul hai?) Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : uskey liye tauba ki gunjaaish kaisey ho sakti hai? mainey tumharey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna hai : maqtool qatil ko pakad kar layega jab ke maqtool ki ragon sey khoon beh raha hoga aur wo keh raha hoga : ya-Allah ! is sey poochh, is ney mujhey kis bina par qatl kiya? phir farmaya : Allah ki qism ! ye (pichhli hadees mein mazkur) aayat Allah Taala ney utaari hai aur isey mansookh nahin farmaya."
"5188","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kabeera gunah ye hain : Allah Taala key sath shareek banana, waliden ki nafarmani karna, kisi (be-gunah) ko qatl karna aur jhooti baat karna."
"5189","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kabeera gunah ye hain : Allah Taala key sath shareek banana, waliden ki nafarmani karna, kisi (be-gunah) ko qatl karna aur jhooti baat karna."
"5190","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : badey badey gunah ye hain : Allah Taala key sath shareek thehrana, maa baap ki nafarmani karna, kisi be-gunah jaan ko qatl karna aur jhooti qism khana."
"5191","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : badey badey gunah ye hain : Allah Taala key sath shareek thehrana, maa baap ki nafarmani karna, kisi be-gunah jaan ko qatl karna aur jhooti qism khana."
"5192","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab koi banda zina karta hai to wo momin nahin rehta. jab koi sharab peeta hai to sharab peetey waqt momin nahin rehta. jab koi chori karta hai to momin nahin rehta aur qatl karta hai to bhi momin nahin rehta."
"5193","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab koi banda zina karta hai to wo momin nahin rehta. jab koi sharab peeta hai to sharab peetey waqt momin nahin rehta. jab koi chori karta hai to momin nahin rehta aur qatl karta hai to bhi momin nahin rehta."
"5194","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab koi shakhs zina karta hai to wo momin nahin hota. jab koi shakhs chori karta hai to wo sahbe-emaan nahin hota. jab koi shakhs sharab peeta hai to wo eman sey la-taaluq ho jata hai. aur jab koi shakhs taqat aur quwat key zor par zabardasti daaka daalta hai ke log be-chaarey dekhtey reh jatey hain to wo bhi eman sey khaali hota hai."
"5195","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab koi shakhs zina karta hai to wo momin nahin hota. jab koi shakhs chori karta hai to wo sahbe-emaan nahin hota. jab koi shakhs sharab peeta hai to wo eman sey la-taaluq ho jata hai. aur jab koi shakhs taqat aur quwat key zor par zabardasti daaka daalta hai ke log be-chaarey dekhtey reh jatey hain to wo bhi eman sey khaali hota hai."
"5196","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : zaani jab zina karta hai to momin nahin hota. chor jab chori karta hai to momin nahin hota. aur shraabi jab sharab peeta hai to momin nahin hota. albatta tauba phir bhi ho sakti hai."
"5197","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : zaani jab zina karta hai to momin nahin hota. chor jab chori karta hai to momin nahin hota. aur shraabi jab sharab peeta hai to momin nahin hota. albatta tauba phir bhi ho sakti hai."
"5198","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey marwi hai ke jab koi shakhs zina karta hai to wo momin nahin hota. aur (jab koi shakhs) chori karta hai to wo momin nahin hota aur (jab) sharab peeta hai to momin nahin hota. unhoney eik chauthi chiz ka bhi zikr farmaya lekin main bhool gaya. jo aadmi ye kaam karta hai wo Islam ka toq apni gardan sey utaar deta hai lekin agar wo tauba karey to Allah Taala uski tauba qubul farma leta hai."
"5199","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey marwi hai ke jab koi shakhs zina karta hai to wo momin nahin hota. aur (jab koi shakhs) chori karta hai to wo momin nahin hota aur (jab) sharab peeta hai to momin nahin hota. unhoney eik chauthi chiz ka bhi zikr farmaya lekin main bhool gaya. jo aadmi ye kaam karta hai wo Islam ka toq apni gardan sey utaar deta hai lekin agar wo tauba karey to Allah Taala uski tauba qubul farma leta hai."
"5200","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Allah Taala chor par lanat karey wo andaa churaa leta hai to us ka haath kaat diya jata hai. rassi churaa leta hai to us ka haath kaat diya jata hai."
"5201","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Allah Taala chor par lanat karey wo andaa churaa leta hai to us ka haath kaat diya jata hai. rassi churaa leta hai to us ka haath kaat diya jata hai."
"5202","Hazrat Noman bin Bashir (Raziallahu anhu) sey marwi hai ke banu Kalaa key kuchh logon ney unkey paas muqadma pesh kiya ke kapda bananey waley kuchh logon ney hamara saman churaa liya hai. unhoney in ko chand din qaid mein rakha, phir chhod diya. muqadma pesh karney waley aaye aur kaha : aap ney in ko baghair kisi maar pit aur tehqiq aur chhaanbeen key chhod diya hai? Hazrat Noman ney farmaya : tum kya chahtey ho? agar tum chaho to main in ko maar-pit karta hun. agar tumhara saman un sey baraamat ho gaya to behtar warna main tumhari peethon par bhi utni hi maar-peet karunga. unhoney kaha : ye aap ka faisla hai? unhoney farmaya : ye Allah Taala ka faisla hai uskey Rasool mukarram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka faisla hai."
"5203","Hazrat Noman bin Bashir (Raziallahu anhu) sey marwi hai ke banu Kalaa key kuchh logon ney unkey paas muqadma pesh kiya ke kapda bananey waley kuchh logon ney hamara saman churaa liya hai. unhoney in ko chand din qaid mein rakha, phir chhod diya. muqadma pesh karney waley aaye aur kaha : aap ney in ko baghair kisi maar pit aur tehqiq aur chhaanbeen key chhod diya hai? Hazrat Noman ney farmaya : tum kya chahtey ho? agar tum chaho to main in ko maar-pit karta hun. agar tumhara saman un sey baraamat ho gaya to behtar warna main tumhari peethon par bhi utni hi maar-peet karunga. unhoney kaha : ye aap ka faisla hai? unhoney farmaya : ye Allah Taala ka faisla hai uskey Rasool mukarram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka faisla hai."
"5204","Hazrat Bahaz bin Hakim apney baap sey wo (Bahaz) unkey dada (Hazrat Muawiya bin Haida Qusheri (Raziallahu anhu) ) sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney kuchh logon ko eik ilzam mein qaid kar diya tha."
"5205","Hazrat Bahaz bin Hakim apney baap sey wo (Bahaz) unkey dada (Hazrat Muawiya bin Haida Qusheri (Raziallahu anhu) ) sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney kuchh logon ko eik ilzam mein qaid kar diya tha."
"5206","Hazrat Bahaz bin Hakim key dada (Hazrat Muawiya bin Haida Qusheri (Raziallahu anhu) ) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney eik aadmi ko kisi ilzam mein qaid kar diya tha, phir (ilzam sabit na honey par) usey chhod diya."
"5207","Hazrat Bahaz bin Hakim key dada (Hazrat Muawiya bin Haida Qusheri (Raziallahu anhu) ) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney eik aadmi ko kisi ilzam mein qaid kar diya tha, phir (ilzam sabit na honey par) usey chhod diya."
"5208","Hazrat Abu Umaiya Makhzoomi (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas eik chor laya gaya jisney khud-ba-khud chori ka aetraaf kiya tha lekin uskey paas (chori ka) saman nahin mila tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us sey farmaya : main nahin samajhta ke tu ney chori ki hogi. us ney kaha : kyon nahin (balke ki hai). aap ney farmaya : isey ley jao aur iska haath kaat kar phir merey paas ley aao. wo us ka haath kaat kar usey wapis laye to aap ney usey farmaya : keh main Allah Taala sey bakhshish talab karta hun aur tauba karta hun. us ney yehi alfaz dohra diye. aap ney farmaya : aey Allah ! iski tauba qubul farma."
"5209","Hazrat Abu Umaiya Makhzoomi (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas eik chor laya gaya jisney khud-ba-khud chori ka aetraaf kiya tha lekin uskey paas (chori ka) saman nahin mila tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us sey farmaya : main nahin samajhta ke tu ney chori ki hogi. us ney kaha : kyon nahin (balke ki hai). aap ney farmaya : isey ley jao aur iska haath kaat kar phir merey paas ley aao. wo us ka haath kaat kar usey wapis laye to aap ney usey farmaya : keh main Allah Taala sey bakhshish talab karta hun aur tauba karta hun. us ney yehi alfaz dohra diye. aap ney farmaya : aey Allah ! iski tauba qubul farma."
"5210","Hazrat Safwan bin Umayya (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi ney un ki chadar churaa li. wo usey (chor ko) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas ley aaye to aap ney us ka haath kaat deney ka hukm diya. unhoney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! mainey is ko maaf kar diya. aap ney farmaya : Abu-Wahab ! (maaf hi karna tha tu) hamarey paas laney sey pehley kyon maaf na kar diya? phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney uska haath kaat diya."
"5211","Hazrat Safwan bin Umayya (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi ney un ki chadar churaa li. wo usey (chor ko) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas ley aaye to aap ney us ka haath kaat deney ka hukm diya. unhoney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! mainey is ko maaf kar diya. aap ney farmaya : Abu-Wahab ! (maaf hi karna tha tu) hamarey paas laney sey pehley kyon maaf na kar diya? phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney uska haath kaat diya."
"5212","Hazrat Safwan bin Umayya (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi ney (meri) chadar churaa li. wo usey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas ley gaey. aap ney us ka haath kaat deney ka hukm diya. unhoney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! mainey isey maaf kar diya. aap ney farmaya : Abu-Wahab ! tu ney ye kaam merey paas pesh karney sey pehley kyon na kiya? phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us ka haath kaat diya."
"5213","Hazrat Safwan bin Umayya (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi ney (meri) chadar churaa li. wo usey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas ley gaey. aap ney us ka haath kaat deney ka hukm diya. unhoney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! mainey isey maaf kar diya. aap ney farmaya : Abu-Wahab ! tu ney ye kaam merey paas pesh karney sey pehley kyon na kiya? phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us ka haath kaat diya."
"5214","Hazrat Ata bin Abu Ribaah sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi ney kapda churaa liya. usey pakad kar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laya gaya. aap ney us ka haath kaatney ka hukm dey diya. (kapdey waley) aadmi ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! ye kapda is ko maaf hai. aap ney farmaya : is waqt sey pehley kyon na (maaf) kiya."
"5215","Hazrat Ata bin Abu Ribaah sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi ney kapda churaa liya. usey pakad kar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laya gaya. aap ney us ka haath kaatney ka hukm dey diya. (kapdey waley) aadmi ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! ye kapda is ko maaf hai. aap ney farmaya : is waqt sey pehley kyon na (maaf) kiya."
"5216","Hazrat Safwan bin Umayya (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Baitullah ka tawaf kiya phir namaz padhi phir apni chadar tahiya kar key apney sar key nichey rakh li aur sau gaey. eik chor aaya aur us ney wo chadar unkey sar key nichey sey khiska li. unhoney usey pakad liya aur Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas ley aaye aur kaha : is ney meri chadar churaai hai. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us sey puchha : tu ney iski chadar churaai hai? us ney kaha : ji haan. aap ney (do aadmiyon ko) hukm diya : isey ley jao aur is ka haath kaat do. Safwan ney kaha : mera ye maqsad nahin tha ke aap meri chadar ki bina par is ka haath kaat den. aap ney farmaya : is sey pehley kyon (maaf) na kiya. Ash-as bin Sawar ney iski mukhalifat ki hai."
"5217","Hazrat Safwan bin Umayya (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Baitullah ka tawaf kiya phir namaz padhi phir apni chadar tahiya kar key apney sar key nichey rakh li aur sau gaey. eik chor aaya aur us ney wo chadar unkey sar key nichey sey khiska li. unhoney usey pakad liya aur Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas ley aaye aur kaha : is ney meri chadar churaai hai. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us sey puchha : tu ney iski chadar churaai hai? us ney kaha : ji haan. aap ney (do aadmiyon ko) hukm diya : isey ley jao aur is ka haath kaat do. Safwan ney kaha : mera ye maqsad nahin tha ke aap meri chadar ki bina par is ka haath kaat den. aap ney farmaya : is sey pehley kyon (maaf) na kiya. Ash-as bin Sawar ney iski mukhalifat ki hai."
"5218","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai unhoney farmaya : Hazrat Safwan masjid mein soey huye they jabkey un ki chadar unkey (sar key) nichey thi. wo churaa li gaee. in ko jaag aai to chor ja chuka tha. unhoney bhag kar usey pakad liya aur Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas ley aaye. aap ney chor ka haath kaatney ka hukm dey diya. Safwan ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! meri chadar itni qeemti to nahin ke iski bina par kisi aadmi ka haath kaat diya jaey? aap ney farmaya : ye baat is ko merey paas laney sey pehley kyon na sochi. Abu Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai (Rahmatullahi Alaih) ) ney farmaya : (is riwayat ka raawi ) Ash-as Zaeef hai (maqsad ye hai ke Hazrat ibne-Abbas ka zikr is riwayat mein sahih nahin)."
"5219","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai unhoney farmaya : Hazrat Safwan masjid mein soey huye they jabkey un ki chadar unkey (sar key) nichey thi. wo churaa li gaee. in ko jaag aai to chor ja chuka tha. unhoney bhag kar usey pakad liya aur Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas ley aaye. aap ney chor ka haath kaatney ka hukm dey diya. Safwan ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! meri chadar itni qeemti to nahin ke iski bina par kisi aadmi ka haath kaat diya jaey? aap ney farmaya : ye baat is ko merey paas laney sey pehley kyon na sochi. Abu Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai (Rahmatullahi Alaih) ) ney farmaya : (is riwayat ka raawi ) Ash-as Zaeef hai (maqsad ye hai ke Hazrat ibne-Abbas ka zikr is riwayat mein sahih nahin)."
"5220","Hazrat Safwan bin Umayya (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : main masjid mein apni munaqqash (dhaari daar) chadar par soyaa huwa tha jiski qeemat tees dirham thi. eik aadmi aaya aur usey khiska ley gaya. wo aadmi pakda gaya aur Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laya gaya. aap ney us ka haath kaatney ka hukm dey diya. main aap key paas aaya aur arz kiya : aap sirf tees dirham key badley is ka haath kaat rahey hain? main ye chadar is ko bech deta hun. qeemat is sey baad mein ley lunga. aap ney farmaya : ye sab kuchh merey paas muqadma laney sey pehley kyon na kiya?"
"5222","Hazrat Safwan bin Umayya (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : main masjid mein apni munaqqash (dhaari daar) chadar par soyaa huwa tha jiski qeemat tees dirham thi. eik aadmi aaya aur usey khiska ley gaya. wo aadmi pakda gaya aur Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laya gaya. aap ney us ka haath kaatney ka hukm dey diya. main aap key paas aaya aur arz kiya : aap sirf tees dirham key badley is ka haath kaat rahey hain? main ye chadar is ko bech deta hun. qeemat is sey baad mein ley lunga. aap ney farmaya : ye sab kuchh merey paas muqadma laney sey pehley kyon na kiya?"
"5223","Hazrat Safwan bin Umayya (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke merey sar key nichey sey eik dhaari daar chadar churaa li gaee jabkey wo Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki masjid mein soey huye they. wo chor ko pakad kar Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas ley aaye. aap ney us ka haath kaatney ka hukm dey diya. Safwan ney kaha : aap (itni chiz mein) iska haath kaat dengey? (main isey maaf karta hun). aap ney farmaya : tu ney isey merey paas laney sey pehley kyon na chhod diya?"
"5224","Hazrat Safwan bin Umayya (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke merey sar key nichey sey eik dhaari daar chadar churaa li gaee jabkey wo Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki masjid mein soey huye they. wo chor ko pakad kar Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas ley aaye. aap ney us ka haath kaatney ka hukm dey diya. Safwan ney kaha : aap (itni chiz mein) iska haath kaat dengey? (main isey maaf karta hun). aap ney farmaya : tu ney isey merey paas laney sey pehley kyon na chhod diya?"
"5225","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib key pardada (Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu)) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : (mulaazimon ko) merey paas pesh karney sey pehley hudood maaf kar diya karo. merey paas koi had wala muqadma aaya to had laziman lageygi."
"5226","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib key pardada (Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu)) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : (mulaazimon ko) merey paas pesh karney sey pehley hudood maaf kar diya karo. merey paas koi had wala muqadma aaya to had laziman lageygi."
"5227","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab tak baat tum mein hai, tum hudood maaf kar saktey ho lekin agar koi had wala muqadma mujh tak pahunch gaya to (merey liye) had lagana wajib aur lazim ho jaeyga."
"5228","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab tak baat tum mein hai, tum hudood maaf kar saktey ho lekin agar koi had wala muqadma mujh tak pahunch gaya to (merey liye) had lagana wajib aur lazim ho jaeyga."
"5229","Hazrat ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma sey riwayat hai ke eik Makhzoomi aurat logon sey gharelu saman istimal key liye liya karti thi, phir baad mein mukar jati thi. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us ka haath kaat deney ka hukm diya."
"5230","Hazrat ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma sey riwayat hai ke eik Makhzoomi aurat logon sey gharelu saman istimal key liye liya karti thi, phir baad mein mukar jati thi. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us ka haath kaat deney ka hukm diya."
"5231","Hazrat ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : eik Makhzoomi aurat apni padosanon ki maarfat cheezen udhaar ley liya karti thi, phir baad mein mukar jaya karti thi. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us ka haath kaat deney ka hukm farmaya."
"5232","Hazrat ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : eik Makhzoomi aurat apni padosanon ki maarfat cheezen udhaar ley liya karti thi, phir baad mein mukar jaya karti thi. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us ka haath kaat deney ka hukm farmaya."
"5233","Hazrat ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma sey riwayat hai ke eik aurat logon key zewrat mang kar ley jaya karti thi aur phir wapis karney sey inkar kar deti thi. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ye aurat Allah aur uskey Rasool key samney elaniya-tauba karey aur jo kuchh is ney logon sey liya hai in ko wapis kerey. (lekin wo aurat na maana tu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Bilal ! utho aur iska haath kaat do."
"5234","Hazrat ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma sey riwayat hai ke eik aurat logon key zewrat mang kar ley jaya karti thi aur phir wapis karney sey inkar kar deti thi. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ye aurat Allah aur uskey Rasool key samney elaniya-tauba karey aur jo kuchh is ney logon sey liya hai in ko wapis kerey. (lekin wo aurat na maana tu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Bilal ! utho aur iska haath kaat do."
"5235","Hazrat Naafey (Rahmatullahi Alaih) sey riwayat hai ke eik aurat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key zamaney mein istimal key liye zewrat mang liya karti thi. is tarah us ney kafi zewrat ikhattey kar liye. phir wo apney paas rakh liye (aur wapis karney sey mukar gaee) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : is aurat ko chahiye ke wo tauba karey aur jo kuchh us ney liya hai, wapis kerey. aap ney kaee dafa farmaya magar wo na maani. aakhir us ka haath kaat diya gaya."
"5236","Hazrat Naafey (Rahmatullahi Alaih) sey riwayat hai ke eik aurat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key zamaney mein istimal key liye zewrat mang liya karti thi. is tarah us ney kafi zewrat ikhattey kar liye. phir wo apney paas rakh liye (aur wapis karney sey mukar gaee) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : is aurat ko chahiye ke wo tauba karey aur jo kuchh us ney liya hai, wapis kerey. aap ney kaee dafa farmaya magar wo na maani. aakhir us ka haath kaat diya gaya."
"5237","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke banu Makhzoom ki eik aurat ney chori kar li. usey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laya gaya. us ney Hazrat Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) key yahan panah hasil kar li. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : agar (chori karney wali) Fatima binte Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) bhi hoti to main us ka bhi haath kaat deta. phir is aurat ka haath kaat diya gaya."
"5238","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke banu Makhzoom ki eik aurat ney chori kar li. usey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laya gaya. us ney Hazrat Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) key yahan panah hasil kar li. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : agar (chori karney wali) Fatima binte Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) bhi hoti to main us ka bhi haath kaat deta. phir is aurat ka haath kaat diya gaya."
"5239","Hazrat Saeed bin Musaiyab sey marwi hai ke banu Makhzoom ki eik aurat ney dusrey logon key wastey sey zewar istimal key liye liya, baad mein mukar gaee to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key hukm sey us ka haath kaat diya gaya."
"5240","Hazrat Saeed bin Musaiyab sey marwi hai ke banu Makhzoom ki eik aurat ney dusrey logon key wastey sey zewar istimal key liye liya, baad mein mukar gaee to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key hukm sey us ka haath kaat diya gaya."
"5241","حدثنا عبيد، قال: \رأيت ابن عمر يلون لحيته بالصفر فسألته، فقال: رأيت النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم يلون لحيته بالصفر\""\n Narrated by 'Ubaid: \""I saw Ibn 'Umar dyeing his beard yellow and I asked him about that. He said: 'I saw the Prophet [SAW] dye his beard yellow.\"""""""
"5242","حدثنا ابن عمر، قال: \قال النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم: 'كان النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم يلون لحيته بالصفر ويرتدي من الصندل الصبتي ويستخدم الورد والزعفران'، وكان ابن عمر يفعل ذلك\""\n Narrated by Ibn 'Umar: \""The Prophet [SAW] used to wear Sibtiyyah sandals and dye his beard yellow with Wars and saffron.\"" And Ibn 'Umar used to do that."""""
"5243","Hazrat Sufiyan sey marwi (riwayat hui) hai ke eik Makhzoomi aurat logon sey saman mang kar ley jati , phir (wapis karney sey) mukar jaya karti thi. usey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki adaalat mein pesh kiya gaya, isi ke sath uskey barey mein (maafi ki) sifarish bhi ki gaee. aap ney farmaya : agar (meri beti) Fatima hoti to main us ka bhi haath kaat deta. Sufiyan sey puchha gaya : (ye riwayat) kis ney bayan ki hai? unhoney kaha : Ayub bin Musa ney Zohri sey, unhoney Urwa sey, unhoney Aaisha sey. (Insha-Allah)."
"5244","Hazrat Sufiyan sey marwi (riwayat hui) hai ke eik Makhzoomi aurat logon sey saman mang kar ley jati , phir (wapis karney sey) mukar jaya karti thi. usey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki adaalat mein pesh kiya gaya, isi ke sath uskey barey mein (maafi ki) sifarish bhi ki gaee. aap ney farmaya : agar (meri beti) Fatima hoti to main us ka bhi haath kaat deta. Sufiyan sey puchha gaya : (ye riwayat) kis ney bayan ki hai? unhoney kaha : Ayub bin Musa ney Zohri sey, unhoney Urwa sey, unhoney Aaisha sey. (Insha-Allah)."
"5245","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke eik aurat ney chori kar li. usey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laya gaya. logon (aurat key rishtey-daaron) ney kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key samney sifarish ki kon himmat kar sakta hai? Usama shayad kerey. unhoney Hazrat Usama (Raziallahu anhu) sey kaha. Usama ney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey (us aurat ki maafi ki) sifarish kar di. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Usama ! banu Israel isi liye halak huye they ke jab un mein koi buland martaba shakhs koi had phalang leta to usey chhod detey aur had na lagatey. aur jab koi kam-martaba shakhs ghalati kar beth'ta to is par had qaaim kar detey. agar uski bajaey Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki beti Fatima hoti to main us ka bhi haath kaat deta."
"5246","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke eik aurat ney chori kar li. usey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laya gaya. logon (aurat key rishtey-daaron) ney kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key samney sifarish ki kon himmat kar sakta hai? Usama shayad kerey. unhoney Hazrat Usama (Raziallahu anhu) sey kaha. Usama ney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey (us aurat ki maafi ki) sifarish kar di. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Usama ! banu Israel isi liye halak huye they ke jab un mein koi buland martaba shakhs koi had phalang leta to usey chhod detey aur had na lagatey. aur jab koi kam-martaba shakhs ghalati kar beth'ta to is par had qaaim kar detey. agar uski bajaey Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki beti Fatima hoti to main us ka bhi haath kaat deta."
"5247","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai unhoney farmaya : Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas eik chor laya gaya. aap ney us ka haath kaat diya. log kehney lagey : hamein ye khayal na tha ke aap us ko is had tak saza dengey. aap ney farmaya : agar (is key bajaey) Fatima hoti to main us ka bhi haath kaat deta."
"5248","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai unhoney farmaya : Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas eik chor laya gaya. aap ney us ka haath kaat diya. log kehney lagey : hamein ye khayal na tha ke aap us ko is had tak saza dengey. aap ney farmaya : agar (is key bajaey) Fatima hoti to main us ka bhi haath kaat deta."
"5249","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke eik aurat ney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key daure mubarak mein chori kar li. log kehney lagey : hum to iskey barey mein aap sey baat nahin kar saktey aur bhi koi nahin kar sakta magar Usama jo aap ko bahut piyarey hain. Hazrat Usama (Raziallahu anhu) ney aap sey sifarish ki to aap ney farmaya : aey Usama ! Bani-Israel is jaisey kamon ki wajeh sey halak huye. jab un mein sey koi buland martaba shakhs chori kar leta to us ko chhod detey aur agar koi kam martaba shakhs un mein chori kar bethta to us ka haath kaat detey. agar (chori karney wali) Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki beti Fatima hoti to main us ka bhi haath kaat deta."
"5250","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke eik aurat ney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key daure mubarak mein chori kar li. log kehney lagey : hum to iskey barey mein aap sey baat nahin kar saktey aur bhi koi nahin kar sakta magar Usama jo aap ko bahut piyarey hain. Hazrat Usama (Raziallahu anhu) ney aap sey sifarish ki to aap ney farmaya : aey Usama ! Bani-Israel is jaisey kamon ki wajeh sey halak huye. jab un mein sey koi buland martaba shakhs chori kar leta to us ko chhod detey aur agar koi kam martaba shakhs un mein chori kar bethta to us ka haath kaat detey. agar (chori karney wali) Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki beti Fatima hoti to main us ka bhi haath kaat deta."
"5251","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai unhoney farmaya : eik aurat ney dusrey logon ki maarfat kuch zewrat aarzi taur par istimal key liye liye. wo log to maroof they magar wo aurat maroof nahin thi. us ney wo zewrat bech diye aur qeemat hazam kar li. usey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laya gaya to uskey ghar waley (sifarish key liye) Hazrat Usama bin Zaid (Raziallahu anha) ki taraf bhagey. Hazrat Usama Raziallahu anhu ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey uski sifarish kar di. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka chehra (ghussey sey) surkh ho gaya. phir aap ney farmaya : to merey paas Allah Taala ki muqarrar karda hudood mein sey eik had na laganey ki sifarish kar raha hai? Usama ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! merey liye bakhshish ki dua farmaiye. phir usi din Zohar key baad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) (khitab key liye) uthey. Allah Taala ki tareef farmaai jo uski shaan key laaiq hai. phir farmaya : sun lo ! tum sey pehley log us bina par halak huye ke jab un mein sey koi buland martaba shakhs chori kar leta tha to usey chhod detey aur jab koi kamzor shakhs chori kar leta to usey had laga detey. qism us zaat ki jis key haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai ! agar Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki beti Fatima chori karti to main us ka haath bhi kaat deta. phir aap ney us aurat ka haath kaat diya."
"5252","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai unhoney farmaya : eik aurat ney dusrey logon ki maarfat kuch zewrat aarzi taur par istimal key liye liye. wo log to maroof they magar wo aurat maroof nahin thi. us ney wo zewrat bech diye aur qeemat hazam kar li. usey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laya gaya to uskey ghar waley (sifarish key liye) Hazrat Usama bin Zaid (Raziallahu anha) ki taraf bhagey. Hazrat Usama Raziallahu anhu ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey uski sifarish kar di. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka chehra (ghussey sey) surkh ho gaya. phir aap ney farmaya : to merey paas Allah Taala ki muqarrar karda hudood mein sey eik had na laganey ki sifarish kar raha hai? Usama ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! merey liye bakhshish ki dua farmaiye. phir usi din Zohar key baad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) (khitab key liye) uthey. Allah Taala ki tareef farmaai jo uski shaan key laaiq hai. phir farmaya : sun lo ! tum sey pehley log us bina par halak huye ke jab un mein sey koi buland martaba shakhs chori kar leta tha to usey chhod detey aur jab koi kamzor shakhs chori kar leta to usey had laga detey. qism us zaat ki jis key haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai ! agar Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki beti Fatima chori karti to main us ka haath bhi kaat deta. phir aap ney us aurat ka haath kaat diya."
"5253","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke eik Makhzoomi aurat jisney chori ki thi, ki wajeh sey Quraish badey fikrmand huye. wo kehney lagey : iski sifarish Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey kon kerega? phir (khud hi) kehney lagey : iski himmat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key mehbub Usama bin Zaid Raziallahu anhuma key siwa kon kar sakta hai ! Hazrat Usama ney aap sey uski sifarish ki to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : to Allah Taala ki muqarrar karda hudood mein sey eik had (ko nafiz na kerney) ki baabat sifarish kar raha hai? phir aap khadey huye aur khitab kartey huye farmaya : tum logon sey pehley log isi bina par halak huye ke jab un mein sey koi buland martaba shakhs chori kar leta to usey chhod detey they aur jab koi kamzor shakhs chori kar leta to us ko had laga detey. Allah ki qism ! agar (farz kijiye) Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki beti Fatima bhi chori karti to main us ka bhi haath kaat deta."
"5254","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke eik Makhzoomi aurat jisney chori ki thi, ki wajeh sey Quraish badey fikrmand huye. wo kehney lagey : iski sifarish Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey kon kerega? phir (khud hi) kehney lagey : iski himmat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key mehbub Usama bin Zaid Raziallahu anhuma key siwa kon kar sakta hai ! Hazrat Usama ney aap sey uski sifarish ki to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : to Allah Taala ki muqarrar karda hudood mein sey eik had (ko nafiz na kerney) ki baabat sifarish kar raha hai? phir aap khadey huye aur khitab kartey huye farmaya : tum logon sey pehley log isi bina par halak huye ke jab un mein sey koi buland martaba shakhs chori kar leta to usey chhod detey they aur jab koi kamzor shakhs chori kar leta to us ko had laga detey. Allah ki qism ! agar (farz kijiye) Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki beti Fatima bhi chori karti to main us ka bhi haath kaat deta."
"5255","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai unhoney farmaya : Quraish key eik qabiley banu Makhzoom ki eik aurat ney chori kar li. usey pakad kar Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laya gaya. uskey rishtey-daar kehney lagey ke kon iski sifarish kar sakta hai? kuchh log kehney lagey : Hazrat Usama (Raziallahu anhu) ye kaam kar saktey hain. Usama aap key paas aaye aur us aurat ki sifarish ki. aap ney unhen daantaa aur farmaya : Bani-Israel ka haal ye tha ke jab unka koi buland martaba shakhs chori karta tha to usey chhod detey. (kuchh nahin kehtey they.) aur jab koi kam martaba shakhs chori kar leta tha to us ka haath kaat detey. qism us zaat ki jis key haath mein Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki jaan hai ! agar (meri beti) Fatima binte Muhammad chori karti to main us ka bhi haath kaat deta."
"5256","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai unhoney farmaya : Quraish key eik qabiley banu Makhzoom ki eik aurat ney chori kar li. usey pakad kar Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laya gaya. uskey rishtey-daar kehney lagey ke kon iski sifarish kar sakta hai? kuchh log kehney lagey : Hazrat Usama (Raziallahu anhu) ye kaam kar saktey hain. Usama aap key paas aaye aur us aurat ki sifarish ki. aap ney unhen daantaa aur farmaya : Bani-Israel ka haal ye tha ke jab unka koi buland martaba shakhs chori karta tha to usey chhod detey. (kuchh nahin kehtey they.) aur jab koi kam martaba shakhs chori kar leta tha to us ka haath kaat detey. qism us zaat ki jis key haath mein Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki jaan hai ! agar (meri beti) Fatima binte Muhammad chori karti to main us ka bhi haath kaat deta."
"5257","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Quraish ko eik Makhzoomi aurat key mamley ney pareshan kar diya jisney chori kar li thi. wo kehney lagey : iskey barey mein kon sifarish kerega? phir khud hi kehney lagey : iski himmat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key mehbub Usama bin Zaid Raziallahu anhuma key siwa kon kar sakta hai ! Hazrat Usama ney aap sey sifarish ki to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tum sey pehley log isi bina par halak huye ke jab un mein koi bada (choudhri) chori kar leta to usey chhod detey they aur jab koi kam martaba shakhs chori kar leta tha to is par had laga detey they. Allah ki qism ! agar Muhammad ki beti Fatima chori karti to main us ka haath bhi kaat deta."
"5258","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Quraish ko eik Makhzoomi aurat key mamley ney pareshan kar diya jisney chori kar li thi. wo kehney lagey : iskey barey mein kon sifarish kerega? phir khud hi kehney lagey : iski himmat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key mehbub Usama bin Zaid Raziallahu anhuma key siwa kon kar sakta hai ! Hazrat Usama ney aap sey sifarish ki to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tum sey pehley log isi bina par halak huye ke jab un mein koi bada (choudhri) chori kar leta to usey chhod detey they aur jab koi kam martaba shakhs chori kar leta tha to is par had laga detey they. Allah ki qism ! agar Muhammad ki beti Fatima chori karti to main us ka haath bhi kaat deta."
"5259","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key ehade-mubarak mein ghazwa fateh-Makka key moqe par eik aurat ney chori kar li to usey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laya gaya. Hazrat Usama bin Zaid Raziallahu anhuma ney uskey barey mein aap sey baat ki. (maafi ki sifarish ki.) jab unhoney aap sey baat ki to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka chehra anwar mutghaiyar (ghussey sey surkh) ho gaya. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kya to Allah Taala ki muqarrar karda hudood mein sey eik had (ko saaqit kerney) ki baabat sifarish kar raha hai? Hazrat Usama ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! merey liye maafi ki dua farmaiye. phir jab Zohar (ki namaz) hui to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) khadey huye aur Allah ki tareef ki jo Allah ki shaan jaleela key mutabiq thi. phir farmaya : sun lo ! tum sey pehley log isi bina par halak huye ke jab un mein koi ooncha (bada) aadmi chori kar leta to usey chhod detey they. (kuchh na kehtey they) aur jab koi kamzor aadmi chori kar bethta tha to is par had laagu kar detey (usey saza detey) they. phir farmaya : qism us zaat ki jis key haath mein meri jaan hai ! agar Fatima binte Muhammad bhi chori karti to main us ka haath bhi kaat deta."
"5260","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key ehade-mubarak mein ghazwa fateh-Makka key moqe par eik aurat ney chori kar li to usey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laya gaya. Hazrat Usama bin Zaid Raziallahu anhuma ney uskey barey mein aap sey baat ki. (maafi ki sifarish ki.) jab unhoney aap sey baat ki to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka chehra anwar mutghaiyar (ghussey sey surkh) ho gaya. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kya to Allah Taala ki muqarrar karda hudood mein sey eik had (ko saaqit kerney) ki baabat sifarish kar raha hai? Hazrat Usama ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! merey liye maafi ki dua farmaiye. phir jab Zohar (ki namaz) hui to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) khadey huye aur Allah ki tareef ki jo Allah ki shaan jaleela key mutabiq thi. phir farmaya : sun lo ! tum sey pehley log isi bina par halak huye ke jab un mein koi ooncha (bada) aadmi chori kar leta to usey chhod detey they. (kuchh na kehtey they) aur jab koi kamzor aadmi chori kar bethta tha to is par had laagu kar detey (usey saza detey) they. phir farmaya : qism us zaat ki jis key haath mein meri jaan hai ! agar Fatima binte Muhammad bhi chori karti to main us ka haath bhi kaat deta."
"5261","Hazrat Urwa bin Zuber sey mursalan riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key ehade-mubarak mein fateh Makka ki jang key waqt eik aurat ney chori kar li. uski qom key log ghabra kar Hazrat Usama bin Zaid Raziallahu anhuma key paas aaye ke wo uski sifarish farma den. jab Hazrat Usama ney aap sey uski baabat baat cheet ki to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key chehre aqdas ka rang badal gaya. aap ney farmaya : kya to Allah Taala ki hudood mein sey eik had key barey mein sifarish karta hai? Usama ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! merey liye istighfar farmaeyn. Zohar key baad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) khutbey key liye khadey huye aur Allah Taala ki tareef farmaaee jo uski shaan key laaiq hai. phir farmaya : Amma-baad (aey logo ! ) tum sey pehley log is bina par tabah huye ke jab un mein koi taqatwer shakhs chori karta to us ko chhod detey. aur jab koi kamzor shakhs chori karta to is par had nafiz kar detey. qism us zaat ki jis key haath mein Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki jaan hai ! agar (farz karo) Fatima binte Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) chori karti to main us ka bhi haath kaat deta. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us aurat ka haath kaatney ka hukm diya. us ka haath kaat diya gaya. lekin iskey baad us ney bahut achchhi tauba kar li. Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya : uskey baad wo merey paas aaya karti thi aur main uski guzaarishey aur zarooriyaat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein pesh kiya karti thi."
"5262","Hazrat Urwa bin Zuber sey mursalan riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key ehade-mubarak mein fateh Makka ki jang key waqt eik aurat ney chori kar li. uski qom key log ghabra kar Hazrat Usama bin Zaid Raziallahu anhuma key paas aaye ke wo uski sifarish farma den. jab Hazrat Usama ney aap sey uski baabat baat cheet ki to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key chehre aqdas ka rang badal gaya. aap ney farmaya : kya to Allah Taala ki hudood mein sey eik had key barey mein sifarish karta hai? Usama ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! merey liye istighfar farmaeyn. Zohar key baad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) khutbey key liye khadey huye aur Allah Taala ki tareef farmaaee jo uski shaan key laaiq hai. phir farmaya : Amma-baad (aey logo ! ) tum sey pehley log is bina par tabah huye ke jab un mein koi taqatwer shakhs chori karta to us ko chhod detey. aur jab koi kamzor shakhs chori karta to is par had nafiz kar detey. qism us zaat ki jis key haath mein Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki jaan hai ! agar (farz karo) Fatima binte Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) chori karti to main us ka bhi haath kaat deta. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us aurat ka haath kaatney ka hukm diya. us ka haath kaat diya gaya. lekin iskey baad us ney bahut achchhi tauba kar li. Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya : uskey baad wo merey paas aaya karti thi aur main uski guzaarishey aur zarooriyaat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein pesh kiya karti thi."
"5263","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : zamin main eik had ka lagaya jana zamin par rehney walon key liye is baat sey behtar hai ke un par tees din barish barsey."
"5264","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : zamin main eik had ka lagaya jana zamin par rehney walon key liye is baat sey behtar hai ke un par tees din barish barsey."
"5265","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : zamin main eik had nafiz kar dena zamin par basney walon key liye chaalis din ki barish sey bhi ziyada faeydemand hai."
"5266","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : zamin main eik had nafiz kar dena zamin par basney walon key liye chaalis din ki barish sey bhi ziyada faeydemand hai."
