"5275","Hazrat ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney eik dhaal ki chori par haath kaat diya tha jiski qeemat teen dirham thi."
"5276","Hazrat ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney eik dhaal ki chori par haath kaat diya tha jiski qeemat teen dirham thi."
"5277","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey marwi hai ke Rasool Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney eik dhaal churaney par haath kaat diya tha.Abu Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai (Rahmatullahi Alaih)) ney farmaya : ye ghalat hai."
"5278","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey marwi hai ke Rasool Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney eik dhaal churaney par haath kaat diya tha.Abu Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai (Rahmatullahi Alaih)) ney farmaya : ye ghalat hai."
"5279","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai unhoney farmaya : Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ney eik dhaal ki chori par haath kaat diya tha jiski qeemat paanch dirham thi. ye durust hai."
"5280","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai unhoney farmaya : Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ney eik dhaal ki chori par haath kaat diya tha jiski qeemat paanch dirham thi. ye durust hai."
"5281","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : eik aadmi ney Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) key daure-mubarak main eik dhaal churaa li. uski qeemat paanch dirham thi to unhoney us ka haath kaat diya."
"5282","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : eik aadmi ney Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) key daure-mubarak main eik dhaal churaa li. uski qeemat paanch dirham thi to unhoney us ka haath kaat diya."
"5283","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney eik chothai deenar chori karney par haath kaataa hai."
"5284","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney eik chothai deenar chori karney par haath kaataa hai."
"5285","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : (chor ka) haath nahin kaataa jaeyga magar eik dhaal ki qeemat mein (yani) tihai deenar ya nisf (aadhey) deenar ya us sey zayed mein."
"5286","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : (chor ka) haath nahin kaataa jaeyga magar eik dhaal ki qeemat mein (yani) tihai deenar ya nisf (aadhey) deenar ya us sey zayed mein."
"5287","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : chor ka haath chothai deenar ki chori par kaat diya jaeyga."
"5288","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : chor ka haath chothai deenar ki chori par kaat diya jaeyga."
"5289","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : chor ka haath chothai deenar par ya us sey zayed ki chori par kaat diya jaeyga."
"5290","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : chor ka haath chothai deenar par ya us sey zayed ki chori par kaat diya jaeyga."
"5291","حدثنا ابن عمر، قال: \قال النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم: 'أنا لا أرتدي خاتماً بعد الآن'، ثم خذ خاتماً من الفضة\""\n Narrated by Ibn 'Umar: \""The Messenger of Allah [SAW] put on a ring of gold and he used to wear its stone (Fass) next to his palm. Then the people started to wear rings too. Then the Messenger of Allah [SAW] threw it away and said: 'I will never wear it again.' Then the Messenger of Allah [SAW] took a ring of silver.\"""""""
"5292","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ka bayan hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : chor ka haath chothai deenar ya us sey zayed ki chori par kaat diya jaeyga."
"5293","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : chor ka haath chothai deenar ya us sey zayed ki chori par kaat diya jaeyga."
"5294","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : chor ka haath chothai deenar ya us sey zayed ki chori par kaat diya jaeyga."
"5295","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya : chor ka haath chothai deenar ya is sey zayed ki chori mein kaataa jaeyga."
"5296","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya : chor ka haath chothai deenar ya is sey zayed ki chori mein kaataa jaeyga."
"5297","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) chothai deenar ya is sey zayed ki chori mein (chor ka haath) kaat diya kartey they."
"5298","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) chothai deenar ya is sey zayed ki chori mein (chor ka haath) kaat diya kartey they."
"5299","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey manqul hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : chor ka haath chothai deenar ya is sey zayed ki chori mein kaataa jaeyga. (kam mein nahin.)"
"5300","حدثنا وافقيد بن عمرو، قال: \دخلت على أنس بن مالك وهو قد جاء إلى المدينة فسلم عليه فقال: 'أين تأتي؟' قلت: 'أنا وافقيد بن عمرو بن سعد بن معاذ'، فقال: 'كان سعد أكبر الناس وأحسنهم'، ثم بكى كثيرا\""\n Narrated by Wafid bin 'Amr bin Sa'd bin Mu'adh: \""I entered upon Anas bin Malik when he came to Al-Madinah and greeted him with Salam. He said: 'Where are you from?' I said: 'I am Wafid bin 'Amr bin Sa'd bin Mu'adh.' He said: 'Sa'd was the greatest and most virtuous of people.' Then he wept a great deal.\"""""""
"5301","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey marwi hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : chor ka haath chothai deenar ya us sey zayed ki chori mein kaataa jaeyga."
"5302","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey marwi hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : chor ka haath chothai deenar ya us sey zayed ki chori mein kaataa jaeyga."
"5303","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) farmati thin : chothai deenar ya us sey zayed ki chori mein haath kaataa jaeyga. Abu Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai (Rahmatullahi Alaih)) ney farmaya : Yahya ki hadees sey ye durust hai."
"5304","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) farmati thin : chothai deenar ya us sey zayed ki chori mein haath kaataa jaeyga. Abu Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai (Rahmatullahi Alaih)) ney farmaya : Yahya ki hadees sey ye durust hai."
"5305","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya : chor ka haath chothai deenar ya us sey zayed ki chori mein kaat diya jaeyga."
"5306","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya : chor ka haath chothai deenar ya us sey zayed ki chori mein kaat diya jaeyga."
"5307","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) farmati hain ke haath kaatney ka hukm chothai deenar ya us sey zayed ki chori mein laagu hota hai."
"5308","حدثنا عثمان، قال: \سمعت النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم منح رخصة إلى عبد الرحمن بن عوف وعزر بن الأوامر في الشدائد بسبب الجذام، فيسمح لهما بارتداء القمصان الحريرية\""\n Narrated by Abdullah bin 'Amr: The Messenger of Allah [SAW] granted a concession to 'Abdur-Rahman bin 'Awf and Az-Zubair bin Al-'Awwam allowing them to wear silken shirts because of scabies that they were suffering from."""""
"5309","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya : ziyada arsa nahin guzra aur na main bhooli hun ke haath kaatney ka hukm chothai deenar ya us sey zayed ki chori par laagu hota tha."
"5310","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya : ziyada arsa nahin guzra aur na main bhooli hun ke haath kaatney ka hukm chothai deenar ya us sey zayed ki chori par laagu hota tha."
"5311","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : chor ka haath chothai deenar ya us sey zayed ki chori key baghair nahin kaataa jaeyga."
"5312","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : chor ka haath chothai deenar ya us sey zayed ki chori key baghair nahin kaataa jaeyga."
"5313","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey aisey hi alfaz naqal farmaai hain."
"5314","حدثنا عبد الله بن عمرو، قال: \رأى النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم سروالين ملونين بالسمر فقال: 'هذا لباس الكفار، لا تلبسه'\""\n Narrated by Abdullah bin 'Amr: The Messenger of Allah [SAW] saw him wearing two garments dyed with safflower and he said: 'This is the clothing of disbelievers; do not wear it.\"""""""
"5315","حدثنا عبد الله بن عمرو، قال: \جاء إلى النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم سروالان ملونان بالسمر فغضب وقال: 'اذهب وأزلهما'، قال: 'أين ألقيهما؟'\""\n Narrated by 'Abdullah bin 'Amr: He came to the Prophet [SAW] wearing two garments dyed with safflower. The Prophet [SAW] got angry and said: 'Go and take them off.' He said: 'Where should I throw them?\"""""""
"5316","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya : haath kaatney ka hukm chothai deenar ya us sey zayed ki chori mein nafiz hoga."
"5317","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ka bayan hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : chor ka haath dhaal ki qeemat key barabar chori par kaat diya jaey aur (us waqt ) dhaal ki qeemat chothai deenar thi."
"5318","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ka bayan hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : chor ka haath dhaal ki qeemat key barabar chori par kaat diya jaey aur (us waqt ) dhaal ki qeemat chothai deenar thi."
"5319","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) chothai deenar ya us sey zayed ki chori mein (chor ka) haath kaataa kartey they."
"5320","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) chothai deenar ya us sey zayed ki chori mein (chor ka) haath kaataa kartey they."
"5321","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : chothai deenar sey kam ki chori mein haath nahin kaataa jaeyga."
"5322","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : chothai deenar sey kam ki chori mein haath nahin kaataa jaeyga."
"5323","Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ney bayan farmaya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka farman hai : dhaal ki chori mein haath kaataa jaeyga."
"5324","Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ney bayan farmaya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka farman hai : dhaal ki chori mein haath kaataa jaeyga."
"5325","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ka bayan hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : dhaal sey kam ki chori mein chor ka haath nahin kaataa jaeyga. Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey puchha gaya : dhaal ki qeemat kitni thi? unhoney farmaya : chothai deenar."
"5326","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ka bayan hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : dhaal sey kam ki chori mein chor ka haath nahin kaataa jaeyga. Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey puchha gaya : dhaal ki qeemat kitni thi? unhoney farmaya : chothai deenar."
"5327","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : chor ka haath chothai deenar ya is sey zayed ki chori key ilawa (kam mein) nahin kaataa jaeyga."
"5328","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : chor ka haath chothai deenar ya is sey zayed ki chori key ilawa (kam mein) nahin kaataa jaeyga."
"5329","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) bayan farmati thin ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : dhaal ya uski qeemat sey kam ki chori mein haath nahin kaataa jaeyga."
"5330","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) bayan farmati thin ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : dhaal ya uski qeemat sey kam ki chori mein haath nahin kaataa jaeyga."
"5331","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) bayan farmati thin ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : (chor ka) haath dhaal ya uski qeemat sey kam ki chori mein nahin kaataa jaeyga. (raawi hadees Usman bin Abul-Waleed ka khayal hai ke) Hazrat Urwa ney kaha ke dhaal chaar dirham ki hoti hai. Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey ye alfaz bhi manqul hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : haath chothai deenar ya us sey zayed (ki chori) key ilawa nahin kaataa ja sakta."
"5332","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) bayan farmati thin ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : (chor ka) haath dhaal ya uski qeemat sey kam ki chori mein nahin kaataa jaeyga. (raawi hadees Usman bin Abul-Waleed ka khayal hai ke) Hazrat Urwa ney kaha ke dhaal chaar dirham ki hoti hai. Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey ye alfaz bhi manqul hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : haath chothai deenar ya us sey zayed (ki chori) key ilawa nahin kaataa ja sakta."
"5333","Hazrat Suleman (Alaihissalam) bin Yasar (Rahmatullahi Alaih) ney farmaya : paanch (ungliyan) nahin kaati jaeyngi magar paanch (dirham ki chori) main. Hamaam ney kaha ke main Abdullah Daanaj ko mila to unhoney mujhey Suleman (Alaihissalam) bin Yasar (Rahmatullahi Alaih) sey hadees bayan ki ke unhoney kaha : paanch nahin kaati jaeyngi magar paanch mein."
"5334","Hazrat Suleman (Alaihissalam) bin Yasar (Rahmatullahi Alaih) ney farmaya : paanch (ungliyan) nahin kaati jaeyngi magar paanch (dirham ki chori) main. Hamaam ney kaha ke main Abdullah Daanaj ko mila to unhoney mujhey Suleman (Alaihissalam) bin Yasar (Rahmatullahi Alaih) sey hadees bayan ki ke unhoney kaha : paanch nahin kaati jaeyngi magar paanch mein."
"5335","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya : dhaal sey kam qeemat ki chiz mein chor ka haath nahin kaataa jaeyga. aur (har qisam ki) dhaal kafi qeemat ki hoti thi."
"5336","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya : dhaal sey kam qeemat ki chiz mein chor ka haath nahin kaataa jaeyga. aur (har qisam ki) dhaal kafi qeemat ki hoti thi."
"5337","Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney paanch dirham qeemat rakhney wali chiz (ki chori) main haath kaataa hai."
"5338","Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney paanch dirham qeemat rakhney wali chiz (ki chori) main haath kaataa hai."
"5339","Hazrat Aiman sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney chor ka haath dhaal ki qeemat sey kam mein nahin kaataa. aur dhaal ki qeemat un dino eik deenar (das dirham) hoti thi."
"5340","Hazrat Aiman sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney chor ka haath dhaal ki qeemat sey kam mein nahin kaataa. aur dhaal ki qeemat un dino eik deenar (das dirham) hoti thi."
"5341","Hazrat Aiman sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key daure-mubarak mein dhaal ki qeemat sey kam chiz ki chori par haath nahin kaataa jata tha. aur dhaal ki qeemat un dino eik deenar thi."
