"5345","Hazrat Aiman sey marwi hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key ehad mein dhaal ki qeemat sey kam mein haath nahin kaataa gaya. aur uski qeemat un dino eik deenar thi."
